<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.900" end="00:00:06.700" style="s2">Ladies and gentlemen, welcome aboard.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.400" end="00:00:09.600" style="s2">We will shortly be arriving at Sterling</p>
<p begin="00:00:06.700" end="00:00:11.100" style="s2">City North Station.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.600" end="00:00:12.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My grandmother and I have always lived</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.100" end="00:00:15.000" style="s2">in a remote town,</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.600" end="00:00:17.600" style="s2">but she&#39;s very sick and needs $50,000</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.000" end="00:00:19.600" style="s2">for surgery. My biological father called</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.600" end="00:00:22.000" style="s2">and offered to pay, but I have to go to</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.600" end="00:00:25.500" style="s2">Sterling City to get the money.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.000" end="00:00:25.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rose, GET OUT OF MY WAY!</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.800" end="00:00:29.600" style="s2">SOMETHING BAD HAPPENED IN THE BACK CARS.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.400" end="00:00:31.400" style="s2">I SAW THE REAPER OF STERLING CITY.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.600" end="00:00:32.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Reaper? Alexander Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.400" end="00:00:36.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he wants you dead, THERE&#39;S NO PLACE</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.599" end="00:00:36.100" style="s2">TO HIDE. RUN NOW!</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.610" end="00:00:42.630" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.700" end="00:00:48.100" style="s2">I&#39;M SORRY, BOSS. I&#39;M SO SORRY.</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.100" end="00:01:00.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re hurt. Let me bandage that for</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.800" end="00:01:00.100" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.700" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">Bear with it.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.000" end="00:01:10.700" style="s2">My grandmother hasn&#39;t been well, so I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.600" end="00:01:12.600" style="s2">picked up some basic medical skills.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.700" end="00:01:14.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone out there wants me dead, yet</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.600" end="00:01:15.600" style="s2">she&#39;s saving me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.300" end="00:01:18.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should get to a hospital as soon as</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.600" end="00:01:18.200" style="s2">possible.</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.185" end="00:01:25.205" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.100" end="00:01:30.400" style="s2">Who What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.600" end="00:01:33.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got my eyes on you.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.400" end="00:01:33.200" style="s2">You&#39;re mine now.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.600" end="00:01:43.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you?</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.500" end="00:01:46.200" style="s2">Let me tell you, I have a husband. Do</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.900" end="00:01:48.500" style="s2">you know who my husband is?</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.200" end="00:01:48.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.800" end="00:01:51.900" style="s2">The Reaper? Alexander Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If he wants you dead, THERE&#39;S NO PLACE</p>
<p begin="00:01:51.900" end="00:01:56.600" style="s2">TO HIDE. RUN NOW!</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.600" end="00:01:59.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY HUSBAND IS Alexander Vance, the</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.600" end="00:01:59.200" style="s2">Reaper.</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.300" end="00:02:05.292" style="s2">Touch his woman and your dead meat.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.692" end="00:02:07.692" style="s2">Scared now?</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.292" end="00:02:09.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS, MOVE. BOSS.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.692" end="00:02:12.492" style="s2">Sorry I&#39;m late, boss. It was the Romano</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.492" end="00:02:14.192" style="s2">family. They&#39;ve been dealt with.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.492" end="00:02:15.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss?</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.192" end="00:02:16.492" style="s2">You are</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.292" end="00:02:18.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our boss is the syndicate boss of</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.492" end="00:02:20.992" style="s2">Sterling City, Alexander Vance, the</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.592" end="00:02:20.992" style="s2">Reaper.</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.892" end="00:02:26.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is Alexander Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.686" end="00:02:30.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.692" end="00:02:35.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you running to, wifey?</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.792" end="00:02:40.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s your wife?</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.292" end="00:02:42.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soon</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.992" end="00:02:44.292" style="s2">I&#39;m going to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.892" end="00:02:45.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Psycho.</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:46.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear passengers, we have arrived at</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.792" end="00:02:47.992" style="s2">Central Station.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.892" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to find Arthur and get the</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.992" end="00:02:52.792" style="s2">medical money for Grandma Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.792" end="00:02:55.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, she hit you. I&#39;m going to teach</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.792" end="00:02:55.292" style="s2">you a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.792" end="00:02:58.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that how you speak to the madam?</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.892" end="00:03:02.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The madam?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.992" end="00:03:03.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, you can have any woman you want.</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.592" end="00:03:05.892" style="s2">Why are you interested in this country</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.792" end="00:03:08.292" style="s2">girl? She hit you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.892" end="00:03:11.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little fire means she cares.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.292" end="00:03:11.392" style="s2">How does she know I won&#39;t hit you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.792" end="00:03:14.092" style="s2">I want all her information within 24</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.392" end="00:03:16.592" style="s2">hours.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.092" end="00:03:16.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.992" end="00:03:23.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. and Mrs. Clark are in the living</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.292" end="00:03:23.592" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.092" end="00:03:31.792" style="s2">Mom, Dad, look. Isn&#39;t it gorgeous?</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.692" end="00:03:35.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.792" end="00:03:37.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our Chloe looks stunning in everything.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.792" end="00:03:40.792" style="s2">This dress is custom made. It costs</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.792" end="00:03:40.792" style="s2">$100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.992" end="00:03:47.092" style="s2">Lily Clark? What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.992" end="00:03:48.592" style="s2">Lily, why didn&#39;t you stay in the</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.092" end="00:03:51.592" style="s2">countryside?</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.592" end="00:03:52.892" style="s2">What are you doing in the city?</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.592" end="00:03:55.192" style="s2">I&#39;m here for Grandma Rose&#39;s medical</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.892" end="00:03:57.892" style="s2">money, $100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.192" end="00:04:00.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $100,000?</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.892" end="00:04:00.592" style="s2">Not a chance.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.892" end="00:04:04.994" style="s2">This dress is enough to save Grandpa</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.594" end="00:04:06.894" style="s2">Rose&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.994" end="00:04:08.494" style="s2">If I remember correctly,</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.894" end="00:04:10.594" style="s2">this house and the company were left to</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:12.694" style="s2">my mother by my grandfather.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.594" end="00:04:14.094" style="s2">It was left to my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.694" end="00:04:15.494" style="s2">After my mother passed away, you and</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.094" end="00:04:18.194" style="s2">your new family just took over</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.494" end="00:04:18.194" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.294" end="00:04:21.094" style="s2">And I was sent to the countryside to</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.594" end="00:04:24.194" style="s2">live with Grandpa Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.094" end="00:04:25.494" style="s2">So asking for 100,000 is not much. You</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.194" end="00:04:28.194" style="s2">give me the money and I&#39;ll leave</p>
<p begin="00:04:25.494" end="00:04:31.494" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.194" end="00:04:32.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. All right.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.494" end="00:04:35.894" style="s2">Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.894" end="00:04:39.294" style="s2">since I promised to give you the money,</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.894" end="00:04:39.294" style="s2">I will certainly give it to you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.694" end="00:04:43.694" style="s2">It&#39;s just that the company is</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.794" end="00:04:44.694" style="s2">experiencing a cash flow problem right</p>
<p begin="00:04:43.694" end="00:04:46.094" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.694" end="00:04:48.494" style="s2">How about this?</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.094" end="00:04:51.094" style="s2">You stay here for two days. By then, I</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.494" end="00:04:54.694" style="s2">will give you the check.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.094" end="00:04:54.694" style="s2">Come. Take her to her room to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.894" end="00:05:05.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, are you really giving Lily</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.894" end="00:05:08.494" style="s2">$100,000?</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.794" end="00:05:12.494" style="s2">Her grandma is already so old. Giving</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.494" end="00:05:14.794" style="s2">her 100,000 is a total waste of money.</p>
<p begin="00:05:12.494" end="00:05:16.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company really is tight on cash. I</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.794" end="00:05:19.294" style="s2">let her stay</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.894" end="00:05:20.794" style="s2">because she has her uses.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.294" end="00:05:22.918" style="s2">Someone is very interested in her</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:24.794" style="s2">astrological chart.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.918" end="00:05:28.394" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.794" end="00:05:28.394" style="s2">It will bring us a massive investment.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.394" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">Boss, here is all the information on</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.894" end="00:05:48.494" style="s2">Miss Clark.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.894" end="00:05:55.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is she now?</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.094" end="00:05:56.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She works at the Grand Apex Hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.394" end="00:06:00.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What job?</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.894" end="00:06:00.194" style="s2">Why would my wife need to work?</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.394" end="00:06:05.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are we going, boss?</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.694" end="00:06:05.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To find my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.095" end="00:06:11.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam wants you to stay in the servants</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.495" end="00:06:11.895" style="s2">quarters.</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.869" end="00:06:23.889" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.695" end="00:06:30.495" style="s2">I&#39;m hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.595" end="00:06:34.495" style="s2">It&#39;s Grandma Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:06:35.095" end="00:06:38.595" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.095" end="00:06:39.795" style="s2">Grandpa Rose.</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.595" end="00:06:41.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.795" end="00:06:43.995" style="s2">have you arrived safely?</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.895" end="00:06:46.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m home. Arthur already transferred the</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.995" end="00:06:48.395" style="s2">$100,000 to me. He even prepared a huge</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.895" end="00:06:50.295" style="s2">feast to welcome me.</p>
<p begin="00:06:48.395" end="00:06:51.795" style="s2">I&#39;m doing great here. I&#39;ll be back in</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.295" end="00:06:53.495" style="s2">two days. Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.795" end="00:06:56.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. At least your father still has</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.495" end="00:06:56.295" style="s2">some conscience.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.595" end="00:07:08.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since I have to stay here for two days,</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.695" end="00:07:09.895" style="s2">I&#39;ll go out and make some money.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.095" end="00:07:12.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can do this, Lily. You are a</p>
<p begin="00:07:09.895" end="00:07:12.595" style="s2">survivor.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.795" end="00:07:18.595" style="s2">From now on, you will be a housekeeper</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.695" end="00:07:20.095" style="s2">at this hotel in charge of cleaning.</p>
<p begin="00:07:18.595" end="00:07:22.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.095" end="00:07:24.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hardworking, steady, and willing to</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.595" end="00:07:24.895" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.495" end="00:07:28.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Supervisor, this is the new housekeeper</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.295" end="00:07:29.795" style="s2">Lily Clark.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.895" end="00:07:30.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.795" end="00:07:31.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.495" end="00:07:33.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.195" end="00:07:33.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.695" end="00:07:39.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you from the countryside?</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.395" end="00:07:41.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.395" end="00:07:44.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can leave. Our hotel won&#39;t hire you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.695" end="00:07:46.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why? Supervisor, Lily is very capable.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.495" end="00:07:47.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A country bumpkin</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.295" end="00:07:49.495" style="s2">reeking of poverty.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.795" end="00:07:50.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Working with someone like her drags down</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.495" end="00:07:53.095" style="s2">our standards.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.595" end="00:07:56.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only VIPs come to our hotel. What if she</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.095" end="00:07:58.495" style="s2">has sticky fingers and steals something?</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.795" end="00:08:00.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Supervisor,</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.495" end="00:08:01.695" style="s2">I can quit this job, but</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.395" end="00:08:03.595" style="s2">please don&#39;t look down on us country</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.695" end="00:08:06.095" style="s2">folks with our prejudice. We country</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.595" end="00:08:07.695" style="s2">folks never steal. We earn our money</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.095" end="00:08:08.197" style="s2">with our own two hands.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.695" end="00:08:09.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.197" end="00:08:10.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; talk back. Let&#39;s see how I teach you a</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.497" end="00:08:12.565" style="s2">LESSON TODAY.</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.497" end="00:08:12.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. VANCE IS HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.565" end="00:08:15.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.797" end="00:08:15.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE DEVIL IS HERE.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.397" end="00:08:34.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.097" end="00:08:36.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse country bumpkin, get out of here</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.497" end="00:08:36.997" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.997" end="00:08:44.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got one</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.397" end="00:08:48.997" style="s2">to live, one</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.297" end="00:08:50.597" style="s2">to give, one chance to keep from</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.997" end="00:08:51.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So impatient.</p>
<p begin="00:08:50.597" end="00:08:54.397" style="s2">Throwing yourself into my arms the</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.697" end="00:08:54.397" style="s2">moment you see me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.497" end="00:08:59.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GOOD DAY MA&#39;AM.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.597" end="00:09:06.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MA&#39;AM? SUPERVISOR, why are they calling</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.397" end="00:09:06.397" style="s2">this country girl ma&#39;am?</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.197" end="00:09:11.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone bullied you. Why didn&#39;t you tell</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.597" end="00:09:12.997" style="s2">them that line?</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.297" end="00:09:14.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What line?</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.997" end="00:09:17.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your husband is</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.497" end="00:09:17.497" style="s2">Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.721" end="00:09:20.741" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:09:20.997" end="00:09:24.297" style="s2">She may be a country girl, but she has</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.397" end="00:09:26.697" style="s2">her husband backing her up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.297" end="00:09:26.697" style="s2">Do it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.997" end="00:09:31.221" style="s2">This hand, right?</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.201" end="00:09:31.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.297" end="00:09:35.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mercy Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.026" end="00:09:41.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.397" end="00:09:43.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, what brings you here? The</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.897" end="00:09:44.797" style="s2">devil himself at our hotel?</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.997" end="00:09:48.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.797" end="00:09:51.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not leaving. I have to work.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.497" end="00:09:51.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m buying your hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.397" end="00:10:00.997" style="s2">Not enough?</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.697" end="00:10:05.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ENOUGH, MORE THAN ENOUGH.</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.997" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">MR. VANCE, this hotel is now yours.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.597" end="00:10:07.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.397" end="00:10:10.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.597" end="00:10:11.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m giving this hotel</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.398" end="00:10:15.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.898" end="00:10:15.298" style="s2">You are the boss now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.398" end="00:10:19.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want it.</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.598" end="00:10:21.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t like others bossing my woman</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.798" end="00:10:23.698" style="s2">around.</p>
<p begin="00:10:21.998" end="00:10:25.898" style="s2">Since you love working so much, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.698" end="00:10:27.498" style="s2">just buy a company for you to play with.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.898" end="00:10:30.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good day, boss Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.498" end="00:10:30.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good day, boss Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.598" end="00:10:35.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This country girl,</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.998" end="00:10:36.498" style="s2">she actually became the owner of the</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.298" end="00:10:38.298" style="s2">hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.498" end="00:10:39.698" style="s2">She is actually Alexander Vance&#39;s woman,</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.298" end="00:10:42.798" style="s2">the devil himself.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.698" end="00:10:42.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want anything from you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.498" end="00:10:48.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Clark, don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.598" end="00:10:58.398" style="s2">You are mine, so everything I own is</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.098" end="00:10:59.698" style="s2">yours. Let&#39;s go. We&#39;re getting married.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.398" end="00:11:01.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get married?</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.698" end="00:11:01.798" style="s2">Mr. Vance, why on earth would I marry</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.098" end="00:11:03.298" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:01.798" end="00:11:05.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why wouldn&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.298" end="00:11:06.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I don&#39;t even know you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.398" end="00:11:07.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s get to know each other right</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.398" end="00:11:08.298" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.598" end="00:11:10.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.298" end="00:11:14.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am Alexander Vance. 80% of the real</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.798" end="00:11:14.598" style="s2">estate in this city belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.198" end="00:11:18.498" style="s2">Oh, and I have 48 private islands. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.498" end="00:11:20.098" style="s2">already had your name added to the</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.498" end="00:11:22.698" style="s2">titles.</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.098" end="00:11:22.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lunatic.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.998" end="00:11:33.498" style="s2">What are you doing? Put me down. PUT ME</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.898" end="00:11:33.498" style="s2">DOWN.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.272" end="00:11:38.947" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.927" end="00:11:38.947" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.598" end="00:11:43.298" style="s2">WHAT ARE YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.198" end="00:11:46.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DIDN&#39;T YOU WANT TO GET TO KNOW ME? Let</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.298" end="00:11:49.098" style="s2">me introduce you</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.698" end="00:11:51.198" style="s2">to the physical hardware.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.098" end="00:11:52.898" style="s2">I&#39;m 6&#39;3</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.198" end="00:11:54.998" style="s2">in perfect health,</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.898" end="00:11:58.098" style="s2">and I&#39;ve never had a woman.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.998" end="00:11:58.098" style="s2">And I have an eight-pack.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.098" end="00:12:01.498" style="s2">Touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.398" end="00:12:02.998" style="s2">Do you like it?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.498" end="00:12:04.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.998" end="00:12:07.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.798" end="00:12:09.798" style="s2">You can touch further down, too.</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.298" end="00:12:12.298" style="s2">A loaded weapon just for you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.798" end="00:12:14.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.298" end="00:12:14.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.798" end="00:12:18.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you me now?</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.999" end="00:12:20.699" style="s2">I have money and looks.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.899" end="00:12:22.099" style="s2">As long as you marry me, I promise to</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.699" end="00:12:24.699" style="s2">make you happy every single day of our</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.099" end="00:12:24.699" style="s2">married life.</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.398" end="00:12:27.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.599" end="00:12:35.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.499" end="00:12:41.299" style="s2">I will never marry you. Give it up.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.999" end="00:12:45.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandma Rose is sick.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.099" end="00:12:46.699" style="s2">You need money.</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.399" end="00:12:50.499" style="s2">I have money.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.699" end="00:12:52.999" style="s2">Marry me and my wealth is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.499" end="00:12:54.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You investigated me?</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.999" end="00:12:56.099" style="s2">I do need money,</p>
<p begin="00:12:54.699" end="00:12:57.399" style="s2">but I only spend the money I earn</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.099" end="00:13:00.299" style="s2">myself,</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.399" end="00:13:00.299" style="s2">the money I deserve.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.399" end="00:13:06.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can you be so naive?</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.399" end="00:13:07.899" style="s2">Only a fool ignores a shortcut in life.</p>
<p begin="00:13:06.399" end="00:13:10.499" style="s2">Do you think just anyone catches my eye</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.899" end="00:13:10.499" style="s2">like you did?</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.399" end="00:13:16.489" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a fiancé.</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.524" end="00:13:18.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.489" end="00:13:18.509" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:13:25.399" end="00:13:29.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll give you time end it with him</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.099" end="00:13:30.699" style="s2">yourself. Tomorrow I will bring the</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.299" end="00:13:33.199" style="s2">engagement gifts to your house and pick</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.699" end="00:13:33.199" style="s2">you up.</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.999" end="00:13:46.019" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.699" end="00:13:50.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.199" end="00:13:52.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason,</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.199" end="00:13:53.999" style="s2">what are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.299" end="00:13:55.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, Grandpa Rose is sick and needs</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.999" end="00:13:57.499" style="s2">100,000 for her medical bills. Why</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.499" end="00:13:58.299" style="s2">didn&#39;t you tell me?</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.499" end="00:14:00.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:13:58.299" end="00:14:02.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve been engaged since we were kids. I</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.099" end="00:14:05.499" style="s2">am your fiancé. No matter what happens,</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.599" end="00:14:05.499" style="s2">we will face it together.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.099" end="00:14:10.899" style="s2">There is $100,000 on this card. Take it</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.399" end="00:14:12.899" style="s2">for now.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.899" end="00:14:14.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason and I grew up together.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.899" end="00:14:17.501" style="s2">He saved my life once and I&#39;ve loved him</p>
<p begin="00:14:14.801" end="00:14:17.501" style="s2">ever since.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.801" end="00:14:20.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.601" end="00:14:22.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.501" end="00:14:25.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="00:14:22.701" end="00:14:25.401" style="s2">Let&#39;s get married.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.901" end="00:14:28.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.001" end="00:14:29.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.401" end="00:14:31.101" style="s2">That&#39;s wonderful. I&#39;ll start planning</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.901" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">the wedding. We&#39;ll get married as soon</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.101" end="00:14:32.801" style="s2">as possible.</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.601" end="00:14:35.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no time. We&#39;re getting married</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.801" end="00:14:35.301" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.001" end="00:14:38.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. We&#39;ll get married tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.601" end="00:14:41.701" style="s2">Let&#39;s go. I&#39;ll take you home first.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.801" end="00:14:41.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I rode my scooter here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.601" end="00:14:47.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silly girl, both of our families are in</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.501" end="00:14:49.901" style="s2">business.</p>
<p begin="00:14:47.801" end="00:14:51.001" style="s2">My company might be small, but we make a</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.901" end="00:14:53.301" style="s2">living.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.001" end="00:14:55.701" style="s2">After we get married, I&#39;ll buy you a car</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.301" end="00:14:57.501" style="s2">around $20,000.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.701" end="00:14:59.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.501" end="00:14:59.901" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.401" end="00:15:24.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drive safely.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.701" end="00:15:24.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.301" end="00:15:30.601" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.001" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">Wow.</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.701" end="00:15:36.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did they come from?</p>
<p begin="00:15:35.101" end="00:15:37.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the latest bulletproof</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.401" end="00:15:39.201" style="s2">Rolls-Royce, top of the line. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.901" end="00:15:41.901" style="s2">probably never be able to afford one in</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.201" end="00:15:41.901" style="s2">my lifetime.</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.401" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">That&#39;s the devil himself, Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.101" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">Good afternoon, Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.501" end="00:15:53.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A deposit just hit my account.</p>
<p begin="00:15:51.401" end="00:15:54.901" style="s2">Thousands, tens of thousands, hundreds</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.301" end="00:15:56.801" style="s2">of thousands, millions,</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.901" end="00:15:57.401" style="s2">hundreds of thousands, millions, 10</p>
<p begin="00:15:56.801" end="00:15:59.101" style="s2">million?</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.401" end="00:16:01.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will not allow my woman to ride a</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.101" end="00:16:03.801" style="s2">scooter. I just transferred $10 million</p>
<p begin="00:16:01.801" end="00:16:05.901" style="s2">for your pocket money. Go buy yourself a</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.801" end="00:16:08.301" style="s2">sports car.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.901" end="00:16:09.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This psychopath.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.301" end="00:16:13.401" style="s2">Mason, let&#39;s turn here.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.301" end="00:16:15.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Okay. Goodbye, Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.401" end="00:16:16.701" style="s2">Boss, isn&#39;t Miss Clark being a bit too</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.001" end="00:16:18.502" style="s2">ungrateful? I think we should just let</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.701" end="00:16:20.102" style="s2">it go. You can&#39;t force a bitter fruit to</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.502" end="00:16:21.302" style="s2">be sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.102" end="00:16:22.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How would I know if it&#39;s sweet without</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.302" end="00:16:25.702" style="s2">taking a bite?</p>
<p begin="00:16:22.902" end="00:16:27.302" style="s2">Besides, even if it&#39;s bitter, it still</p>
<p begin="00:16:25.702" end="00:16:29.202" style="s2">quenches my thirst.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.302" end="00:16:31.102" style="s2">Romance only makes sense when both</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.202" end="00:16:32.502" style="s2">people are out of their minds. Go back</p>
<p begin="00:16:31.102" end="00:16:33.402" style="s2">and prepare the dowry. We&#39;re bringing my</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.502" end="00:16:35.902" style="s2">wife home tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.402" end="00:16:35.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.902" end="00:16:47.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, Mason, how come you two came back</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.302" end="00:16:51.002" style="s2">together?</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.402" end="00:16:51.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Goldman, this is Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.902" end="00:16:54.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Goldman?</p>
<p begin="00:16:58.102" end="00:17:02.502" style="s2">What do you think?</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.302" end="00:17:02.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stunning and fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.702" end="00:17:03.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.302" end="00:17:04.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah?</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.802" end="00:17:05.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Mr. Goldman is looking at me in a</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.902" end="00:17:09.102" style="s2">weird way.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.602" end="00:17:09.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Weird how? You&#39;re just overthinking it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:09.702" end="00:17:13.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I just overthinking it?</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.602" end="00:17:15.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be taking my leave now.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.802" end="00:17:17.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.502" end="00:17:17.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Goldman, we&#39;ll see you tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.302" end="00:17:20.151" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.802" end="00:17:22.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Very good.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.151" end="00:17:22.171" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.302" end="00:17:27.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. and Mrs. Clark?</p>
<p begin="00:17:26.402" end="00:17:28.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:17:27.202" end="00:17:29.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, Lily and I are getting</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.702" end="00:17:31.702" style="s2">married.</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.802" end="00:17:34.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason, you and Lily have had this</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.702" end="00:17:36.902" style="s2">arrangement for a long time. So tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.302" end="00:17:38.492" style="s2">you shall get married. So tomorrow you</p>
<p begin="00:17:36.902" end="00:17:40.512" style="s2">shall get married.</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.492" end="00:17:40.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.502" end="00:17:51.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, Mason, early congratulations on</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.202" end="00:17:51.702" style="s2">your wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.902" end="00:18:02.902" style="s2">Why do I feel like everyone is acting so</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.302" end="00:18:02.902" style="s2">strange?</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.312" end="00:18:09.902" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.202" end="00:18:12.502" style="s2">Today I&#39;m getting married.</p>
