<p begin="00:18:12.502" end="00:18:16.302" style="s2">held in the floral pavilion of the</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.302" end="00:18:19.802" style="s2">Elysium Estate.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.302" end="00:18:19.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move out OF THE WAY. MOVE.</p>
<p begin="00:18:24.303" end="00:18:28.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are these people?</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.103" end="00:18:29.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the devil.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.303" end="00:18:30.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance&#39;s men.</p>
