<p begin="00:18:30.903" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">married today.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.903" end="00:18:35.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His wedding banquet is booked right here</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.903" end="00:18:36.903" style="s2">in the Imperial Hall of the Elysium</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.703" end="00:18:38.603" style="s2">Estate.</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.903" end="00:18:39.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance is getting married? Who&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.603" end="00:18:42.103" style="s2">bride?</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.703" end="00:18:44.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That I don&#39;t know. A man of his stature</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.103" end="00:18:47.003" style="s2">is not someone we can gossip about.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.303" end="00:18:49.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never cross the devil, otherwise you&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:18:47.003" end="00:18:50.903" style="s2">be dead before you know it.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.003" end="00:18:52.203" style="s2">That maniac, he actually set up a</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.903" end="00:18:54.503" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.203" end="00:18:55.703" style="s2">I won&#39;t marry him. The man I&#39;m marrying</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.503" end="00:18:58.203" style="s2">is Mason.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.703" end="00:18:58.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go in.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.903" end="00:19:10.203" style="s2">Lily, today you&#39;re getting married. Your</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.903" end="00:19:12.803" style="s2">father is truly happy for you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.203" end="00:19:14.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finally found yourself a good home.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.803" end="00:19:16.103" style="s2">Where&#39;s Mason?</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.303" end="00:19:19.203" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t he here yet?</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.103" end="00:19:19.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The groom is here.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.703" end="00:19:35.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Goldman, you&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.703" end="00:19:41.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Goldman?</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.668" end="00:19:43.103" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.603" end="00:19:45.003" style="s2">Why is it you?</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.103" end="00:19:46.703" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.003" end="00:19:48.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here for my wedding.</p>
