<p begin="00:19:48.603" end="00:19:55.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With you, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.703" end="00:19:57.403" style="s2">See this? I am the groom today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.103" end="00:19:58.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is Mr. Goldman. Mr. Goldman is the</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.403" end="00:20:00.303" style="s2">groom today.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.803" end="00:20:03.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He came specifically to marry you and</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.303" end="00:20:03.003" style="s2">take you home.</p>
<p begin="00:20:03.603" end="00:20:09.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You and Mr. Goldman [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.803" end="00:20:11.803" style="s2">are simply a perfect match.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.303" end="00:20:14.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, the man I am marrying is Mason</p>
<p begin="00:20:11.803" end="00:20:14.303" style="s2">Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.503" end="00:20:18.203" style="s2">Where is Mason? I need to find him right</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.903" end="00:20:18.203" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.314" end="00:20:21.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.623" end="00:20:21.643" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.103" end="00:20:27.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re sorry. The number have dialed is</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.105" end="00:20:28.794" style="s2">currently unavailable. Please try again</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.405" end="00:20:29.105" style="s2">later.</p>
