<p begin="00:20:29.105" end="00:20:33.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t he answering my calls?</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.705" end="00:20:35.505" style="s2">He said he was going to marry me. Why</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.105" end="00:20:37.205" style="s2">isn&#39;t he here?</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.505" end="00:20:39.405" style="s2">I&#39;m going to find Mason.</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.205" end="00:20:41.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, don&#39;t run. Marry me. I will take</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.405" end="00:20:42.405" style="s2">real good care of you. I&#39;ll take real</p>
<p begin="00:20:41.305" end="00:20:43.605" style="s2">good care of you.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.405" end="00:20:44.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.605" end="00:20:47.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OUCH.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:47.605" style="s2">AH, GOOD.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.305" end="00:20:57.905" style="s2">AH.</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.505" end="00:20:57.905" style="s2">OH.</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.105" end="00:21:05.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; AH.</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.105" end="00:21:10.505" style="s2">IT HURTS so much.</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.705" end="00:21:12.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bit wild, but I like it. I like it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:10.505" end="00:21:13.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.305" end="00:21:14.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.305" end="00:21:16.805" style="s2">this wedding</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.605" end="00:21:18.405" style="s2">is arranged perfectly for you</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.805" end="00:21:19.305" style="s2">and Mr. Goldman.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.405" end="00:21:20.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.305" end="00:21:21.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.705" end="00:21:23.405" style="s2">do you know why I asked you to come back</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.905" end="00:21:25.205" style="s2">to the city? Did you really think I</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.405" end="00:21:27.005" style="s2">would just hand over $100,000 for</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.205" end="00:21:29.005" style="s2">Grandma Rose&#39;s medical bills?</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.005" end="00:21:30.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all because Mr. Goldman&#39;s psychic</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.005" end="00:21:33.505" style="s2">read your star chart, and he&#39;s willing</p>
<p begin="00:21:30.905" end="00:21:36.705" style="s2">to invest $5,000,000 in our family</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.505" end="00:21:38.705" style="s2">business to marry you. Lily Clark,</p>
<p begin="00:21:36.705" end="00:21:40.705" style="s2">you&#39;re just a country nobody, yet you</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.705" end="00:21:43.605" style="s2">delusionally dream of marrying Mason</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.705" end="00:21:46.505" style="s2">Hayes. Do you think you are worthy?</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.605" end="00:21:48.905" style="s2">I&#39;d say you and Mr. Goldman are a match</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.505" end="00:21:49.805" style="s2">made in heaven.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.905" end="00:21:51.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:21:49.805" end="00:21:54.305" style="s2">I might be a little older, but I own a</p>
<p begin="00:21:51.705" end="00:21:56.005" style="s2">massive real estate empire. The psychic</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:58.705" style="s2">said your star chart will bring me</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.005" end="00:22:01.105" style="s2">extreme longevity. Don&#39;t worry. After</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.705" end="00:22:02.505" style="s2">we&#39;re married, I&#39;ll take real good care</p>
<p begin="00:22:01.105" end="00:22:04.805" style="s2">of you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.505" end="00:22:08.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were lying to me all along.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.805" end="00:22:10.505" style="s2">Why am I not your biological daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.405" end="00:22:12.505" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you MY REAL FATHER?</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.505" end="00:22:13.305" style="s2">WHY DID YOU LIE TO ME?</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.505" end="00:22:15.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.305" end="00:22:16.205" style="s2">I only have one daughter, and that is</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.505" end="00:22:17.905" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
