<p begin="00:22:19.405" end="00:22:21.705" style="s2">hour.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.805" end="00:22:24.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, GOOD. LET&#39;S GET MARRIED RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.705" end="00:22:24.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.305" end="00:22:30.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IS IS PREPARATION COMPLETE?</p>
