<p begin="00:22:32.106" end="00:22:36.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, the gold is here. Boss, the</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.306" end="00:22:36.906" style="s2">diamond is here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.806" end="00:22:41.406" style="s2">To be my woman, the gold must be more</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.506" end="00:22:43.506" style="s2">than anyone else&#39;s. The diamond must be</p>
