<p begin="00:22:47.906" end="00:22:50.306" style="s2">SOMEONE ELSE.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.106" end="00:22:53.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT?</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.306" end="00:22:57.006" style="s2">Whoever dares to touch my woman,</p>
