<p begin="00:22:57.206" end="00:22:59.606" style="s2">Guards.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.306" end="00:23:04.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:22:59.606" end="00:23:04.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Follow me and snatch your mom back.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.406" end="00:23:08.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move out.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.306" end="00:23:08.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.706" end="00:23:14.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.806" end="00:23:14.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
