<p begin="00:23:19.306" end="00:23:22.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop the car.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.606" end="00:23:31.906" style="s2">Hey, stop.</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.706" end="00:23:34.206" style="s2">Get off. I&#39;m taking your bike.</p>
