<p begin="00:23:52.206" end="00:23:56.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.106" end="00:23:58.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t disturb Mr. Vance&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.106" end="00:24:00.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we disturb Mr. Vance, WE&#39;RE ALL DEAD.</p>
