<p begin="00:25:25.512" end="00:25:28.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.807" end="00:25:31.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILY ACTUALLY knows Mr. Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.207" end="00:25:33.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, Lily is my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:25:31.507" end="00:25:35.307" style="s2">What is your relationship with her?</p>
<p begin="00:25:33.607" end="00:25:37.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you tell them?</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.307" end="00:25:40.207" style="s2">Tell them your husband</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.107" end="00:25:42.707" style="s2">is Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.207" end="00:25:44.908" style="s2">Now say it loud for everyone to hear.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.707" end="00:25:46.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, what exactly is your relationship</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.908" end="00:25:48.107" style="s2">with Mr. Vance?</p>
