<p begin="00:25:51.007" end="00:25:54.908" style="s2">Alex</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.607" end="00:25:56.007" style="s2">ander Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.908" end="00:25:59.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
