<p begin="00:26:12.908" end="00:26:17.507" style="s2">Lily Clark actually became Mrs. Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.107" end="00:26:19.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could it be the woman Mr. Vance is</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.507" end="00:26:21.707" style="s2">marrying today is Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.307" end="00:26:23.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.707" end="00:26:24.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well said.</p>
<p begin="00:26:23.507" end="00:26:27.307" style="s2">Get used to saying that from now on,</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.807" end="00:26:27.307" style="s2">understood?</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.007" end="00:26:31.707" style="s2">On your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.109" end="00:26:37.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop. Let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:26:34.009" end="00:26:37.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, what should we do with them?</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.509" end="00:26:45.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bullying my woman? Do you think I</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.109" end="00:26:46.909" style="s2">Alexander Vance am dead?</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.609" end="00:26:48.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no. It&#39;s a misunderstanding, Mr.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.909" end="00:26:50.709" style="s2">Vance. I didn&#39;t know Lily was your</p>
<p begin="00:26:48.209" end="00:26:52.309" style="s2">woman. IT&#39;S THE CLARK FAMILY. THEY</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.709" end="00:26:53.409" style="s2">TRICKED ME. THEY WANTED TO SELL THEIR</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.309" end="00:26:55.509" style="s2">DAUGHTER TO ME.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.409" end="00:26:57.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RICHARD, YOU&#39;RE TALKING NONSENSE. You</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.509" end="00:26:58.709" style="s2">were the one who had your eyes on Lily</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.109" end="00:27:00.109" style="s2">because you&#39;re a SICK PERVERT. YOU</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.709" end="00:27:02.109" style="s2">WANTED TO BUY [screaming] HER.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.109" end="00:27:04.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. VANCE, DON&#39;T BELIEVE HIM. PLEASE</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.109" end="00:27:04.909" style="s2">SPARE US.</p>
<p begin="00:27:05.909" end="00:27:09.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THESE PEOPLE ARE YOURS TO deal with.</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.009" end="00:27:13.909" style="s2">Revenge is sweeter when you take it</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.309" end="00:27:13.909" style="s2">yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.409" end="00:27:19.209" style="s2">I&#39;ve got your back.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.709" end="00:27:19.209" style="s2">Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:27:19.609" end="00:27:23.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.109" end="00:27:25.409" style="s2">I I am your father. You You wouldn&#39;t hit</p>
<p begin="00:27:23.909" end="00:27:26.609" style="s2">me, would you?</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.409" end="00:27:27.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say you only had one</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.609" end="00:27:29.809" style="s2">daughter, Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.809" end="00:27:31.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no. I was joking. Please don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.809" end="00:27:33.409" style="s2">take it to heart.</p>
<p begin="00:27:31.109" end="00:27:34.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you claim to be my father,</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.409" end="00:27:37.509" style="s2">then this first strike is for selling</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.709" end="00:27:37.509" style="s2">your own daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.409" end="00:27:43.609" style="s2">That&#39;s for taking what&#39;s mine</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.609" end="00:27:47.009" style="s2">and sleeping your way in.</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.609" end="00:27:48.909" style="s2">That&#39;s for your vicious schemes.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.009" end="00:27:50.924" style="s2">And this is for BEING ABSOLUTELY</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.909" end="00:27:52.509" style="s2">DISGUSTING.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.924" end="00:27:55.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.509" end="00:27:57.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS, MS. CLARK has some real fire.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.809" end="00:28:00.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you forget</p>
<p begin="00:27:57.209" end="00:28:02.409" style="s2">whose woman she is?</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.009" end="00:28:05.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So full of himself.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.409" end="00:28:05.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does your hand hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.909" end="00:28:16.109" style="s2">You finished punishing them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.809" end="00:28:16.109" style="s2">Now it&#39;s my turn to punish you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.909" end="00:28:20.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.209" end="00:28:22.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who gave you permission to secretly</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.409" end="00:28:24.309" style="s2">marry someone else?</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.009" end="00:28:25.809" style="s2">Were you really going to marry Mason?</p>
<p begin="00:28:24.309" end="00:28:27.809" style="s2">Your taste in men</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.809" end="00:28:30.209" style="s2">is absolutely pathetic. Does a piece of</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.809" end="00:28:31.209" style="s2">trash like Mason hates even deserve to</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.209" end="00:28:33.310" style="s2">be compared to me?</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.209" end="00:28:35.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully. You are Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.310" end="00:28:37.910" style="s2">Vance&#39;s woman.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.410" end="00:28:37.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:28:40.610" end="00:28:43.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, I&#39;ve got my bride.</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.810" end="00:28:48.310" style="s2">It&#39;s time for us to get married.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.710" end="00:28:48.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Married?</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.410" end="00:28:58.310" style="s2">Alexander, I&#39;m grateful you saved me,</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.010" end="00:28:59.810" style="s2">but I really can&#39;t marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.310" end="00:29:01.410" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.810" end="00:29:03.710" style="s2">Nana and I grew up in a trailer park.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.410" end="00:29:06.210" style="s2">While you are a powerful billionaire, we</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.710" end="00:29:08.710" style="s2">belong to completely different worlds.</p>
<p begin="00:29:06.210" end="00:29:09.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then welcome to my world.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.710" end="00:29:11.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.710" end="00:29:13.610" style="s2">Alexander, marriage is about two people</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.610" end="00:29:14.610" style="s2">who love each other starting a family. I</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.610" end="00:29:16.110" style="s2">don&#39;t love you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.610" end="00:29:18.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It doesn&#39;t matter if you love me. My</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.110" end="00:29:20.410" style="s2">love is enough for both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.210" end="00:29:20.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.210" end="00:29:30.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations on your wedding, Mr. and</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.110" end="00:29:33.010" style="s2">Mrs. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.210" end="00:29:37.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Mr. and Mrs. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.010" end="00:29:37.310" style="s2">CONGRATULATIONS, MR. AND MRS. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.710" end="00:29:43.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; JUST KEEP YOUR MOUTH SHUT.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.710" end="00:29:45.810" style="s2">This marriage is a notification, not a</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.010" end="00:29:45.810" style="s2">negotiation.</p>
<p begin="00:29:46.810" end="00:29:49.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Psycho.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.810" end="00:29:53.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.110" end="00:30:00.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I really going to marry him?</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.235" end="00:30:05.255" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:30:06.410" end="00:30:10.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.610" end="00:30:10.010" style="s2">Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.110" end="00:30:17.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CALL A DOCTOR.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.110" end="00:30:19.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. VANCE,</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.010" end="00:30:20.510" style="s2">Miss Clark has low blood sugar combined</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.110" end="00:30:22.410" style="s2">with the trauma from being hit with a</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.510" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">blunt object which caused her to pass</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.410" end="00:30:24.710" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.810" end="00:30:30.310" style="s2">Boss, the sweet tea is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.610" end="00:30:39.912" style="s2">She is my woman. I feed her myself.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.912" end="00:30:47.776" style="s2">Once you feel a bit better, we will</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.412" end="00:30:48.512" style="s2">continue our wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.776" end="00:30:50.912" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.512" end="00:30:50.912" style="s2">Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.051" end="00:30:54.812" style="s2">[snorts] It&#39;s Julian Vance calling to</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.812" end="00:30:57.712" style="s2">make his move.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.812" end="00:30:57.712" style="s2">I need to take this call.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.912" end="00:31:04.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I don&#39;t escape now, I never will.</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.712" end="00:31:11.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.012" end="00:31:12.666" style="s2">Nana passed out. You need to come back</p>
<p begin="00:31:11.312" end="00:31:13.512" style="s2">right now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.666" end="00:31:16.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.512" end="00:31:16.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be right there.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.212" end="00:31:22.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, Miss Clark ran away.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.712" end="00:31:23.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare she run?</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.012" end="00:31:25.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find her. Even if you have to tear the</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.212" end="00:31:27.412" style="s2">city apart, I want her found.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.312" end="00:31:29.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Clark, are you truly that terrified</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.412" end="00:31:31.212" style="s2">of a good life? Other people&#39;s romance</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.312" end="00:31:32.612" style="s2">costs time,</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.212" end="00:31:34.312" style="s2">but your romance costs your henchmen</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.612" end="00:31:35.312" style="s2">their lives.</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.312" end="00:31:36.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Search everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.312" end="00:31:38.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.412" end="00:31:39.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prepare a steel cage. Next time, I will</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.612" end="00:31:42.012" style="s2">keep her locked up.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.612" end="00:31:42.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.412" end="00:31:47.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana?</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.912" end="00:31:49.012" style="s2">Nana?</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.812" end="00:31:50.912" style="s2">Nana?</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.012" end="00:31:53.512" style="s2">Nana?</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.912" end="00:31:55.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, why are you back here? [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.512" end="00:31:57.512" style="s2">Why didn&#39;t you stay in the city longer?</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.712" end="00:31:59.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were the ones who called Lily. You</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.512" end="00:32:01.312" style="s2">passed out on the street. How could you</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.212" end="00:32:02.812" style="s2">keep this from Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.312" end="00:32:03.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, are you hurting somewhere? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.812" end="00:32:04.812" style="s2">okay? Come on, we&#39;re going to the</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.912" end="00:32:06.512" style="s2">hospital right now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.812" end="00:32:07.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going. The hospital costs too</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.512" end="00:32:09.312" style="s2">much money. I&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.912" end="00:32:10.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily and her dad must have got the</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.312" end="00:32:12.412" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.512" end="00:32:14.612" style="s2">Nana, just go. Your body</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.412" end="00:32:15.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t tough this out anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.612" end="00:32:17.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.912" end="00:32:20.012" style="s2">If you get better, you&#39;ll be able to</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.612" end="00:32:22.212" style="s2">stay with Lily for a long time, right?</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.012" end="00:32:24.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Leaving Lily all alone in this</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.212" end="00:32:25.912" style="s2">world, that would just be heartbreaking.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.812" end="00:32:29.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.912" end="00:32:31.712" style="s2">I can&#39;t bear to leave my Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.012" end="00:32:32.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on, let&#39;s go. I&#39;ve got you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.712" end="00:32:35.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it easy now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:32.812" end="00:32:35.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful now.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.712" end="00:32:41.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I asked around that Lily Nana lives</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.513" end="00:32:44.013" style="s2">right here.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.413" end="00:32:44.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare that little put her hands</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.013" end="00:32:46.113" style="s2">on us.</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.913" end="00:32:48.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going [snorts] to end that old hag</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.113" end="00:32:48.513" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:32:56.013" end="00:32:59.413" style="s2">What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.713" end="00:33:05.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here? I don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.513" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">see you. Get out. You&#39;re not welcome</p>
<p begin="00:33:05.213" end="00:33:07.513" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.513" end="00:33:14.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t expect Lily Clark to be back.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.513" end="00:33:16.113" style="s2">I suddenly have a great idea.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.413" end="00:33:18.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arthur Clark is a gold digger who</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.113" end="00:33:20.113" style="s2">sponged off her mother&#39;s family. He</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.313" end="00:33:21.913" style="s2">cheated on her and ended up with this</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.113" end="00:33:23.913" style="s2">home wrecker and her daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.913" end="00:33:25.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These two are nothing but trouble. LILY</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.913" end="00:33:27.013" style="s2">CLARK WAS DRIVEN OUT TO THE COUNTRY BY</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.413" end="00:33:28.913" style="s2">THEM. DRIVEN OUT TO THE COUNTRY.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.013" end="00:33:29.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET LOST. OAK CREEK DOESN&#39;T WELCOME your</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.913" end="00:33:31.213" style="s2">kind.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.613" end="00:33:32.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t bully Lily Clark here in Oak</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.213" end="00:33:34.113" style="s2">Creek.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.713" end="00:33:37.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.113" end="00:33:40.413" style="s2">it was all our fault in the past.</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.313" end="00:33:42.213" style="s2">Can you please forgive us?</p>
<p begin="00:33:40.413" end="00:33:43.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that you&#39;ve climbed up the social</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.213" end="00:33:46.213" style="s2">ladder,</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.413" end="00:33:47.813" style="s2">you can&#39;t just drive us into a corner.</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.213" end="00:33:48.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about? Who did she</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.813" end="00:33:51.513" style="s2">climb up to?</p>
<p begin="00:33:48.913" end="00:33:52.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Lily is about to marry Alexander</p>
<p begin="00:33:51.513" end="00:33:54.513" style="s2">Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.413" end="00:33:56.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:33:54.513" end="00:33:59.813" style="s2">Lily, I thought you and Mason Hayes were</p>
<p begin="00:33:56.613" end="00:34:01.113" style="s2">in love. Isn&#39;t Mason Hayes your fiancé?</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.813" end="00:34:02.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fiancé?</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.113" end="00:34:04.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.813" end="00:34:07.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this Alexander Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.813" end="00:34:10.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Alexander Vance is the ruthless</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.113" end="00:34:12.113" style="s2">boss of the Vance family. He has an army</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.113" end="00:34:14.113" style="s2">of private guards.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.113" end="00:34:16.413" style="s2">If he wants you dead by midnight, not</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.113" end="00:34:18.688" style="s2">even God can keep you alive till dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:34:16.413" end="00:34:20.708" style="s2">They call HIM THE GRIM REAPER.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.688" end="00:34:20.708" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.913" end="00:34:25.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILY, IS IT TRUE WHAT SHE SAID?</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:29.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILY,</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.513" end="00:34:30.513" style="s2">are you really with that ruthless</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.213" end="00:34:34.113" style="s2">tyrant?</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.513" end="00:34:36.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Lily has hooked a billionaire now.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.113" end="00:34:39.313" style="s2">We wouldn&#39;t dare offend her. If she</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.313" end="00:34:41.913" style="s2">makes that tyrant unhappy, we&#39;ll all get</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.313" end="00:34:42.814" style="s2">slashed.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.913" end="00:34:45.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could you become so</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.814" end="00:34:46.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; corrupted after going to the city, Lily?</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.214" end="00:34:48.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alas,</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.814" end="00:34:49.914" style="s2">it&#39;s not like that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.514" end="00:34:51.114" style="s2">Please listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.914" end="00:34:53.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.114" end="00:34:56.114" style="s2">I know you are a good girl.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.514" end="00:34:58.814" style="s2">Tell me the truth. Did your father</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.114" end="00:35:02.514" style="s2">really give you no money? Did you go to</p>
<p begin="00:34:58.814" end="00:35:04.014" style="s2">that tyrant just to pay for my surgery?</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.514" end="00:35:06.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just for that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.014" end="00:35:09.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, Nana. Nana,</p>
<p begin="00:35:06.414" end="00:35:12.214" style="s2">I taught you since you were little to be</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.214" end="00:35:15.414" style="s2">an honest and decent person, to be</p>
<p begin="00:35:12.214" end="00:35:18.014" style="s2">strong and resilient.</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.414" end="00:35:20.914" style="s2">It&#39;s all my fault.</p>
<p begin="00:35:18.014" end="00:35:22.934" style="s2">I&#39;m so useless.</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.914" end="00:35:22.934" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.514" end="00:35:24.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, hey, Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.314" end="00:35:25.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.614" end="00:35:27.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.914" end="00:35:29.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong? Is it your heart, Nana? We</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.814" end="00:35:31.614" style="s2">need to go to the hospital. We&#39;re going</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.514" end="00:35:34.214" style="s2">to the hospital right now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.614" end="00:35:37.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.214" end="00:35:39.314" style="s2">I can&#39;t be a burden to you. JUST LET ME</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.614" end="00:35:42.414" style="s2">DIE.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.314" end="00:35:45.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NANA, DON&#39;T SCARE ME, NANA. You are the</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.414" end="00:35:49.314" style="s2">only family I have left, Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.414" end="00:35:49.314" style="s2">I can&#39;t live without you, Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:35:49.734" end="00:35:51.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.214" end="00:35:55.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is what you get for crossing me,</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.814" end="00:35:56.914" style="s2">Lily Clark.</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.514" end="00:35:59.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you all DOING IN HERE? COME</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.914" end="00:36:00.414" style="s2">OUTSIDE, QUICK.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.014" end="00:36:02.814" style="s2">A GREAT PHILANTHROPIST came to town</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.414" end="00:36:05.614" style="s2">giving every household free AC units. GO</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.814" end="00:36:05.614" style="s2">GET THEIRS NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.114" end="00:36:09.914" style="s2">A GREAT PHILANTHROPIST.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.214" end="00:36:12.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE DID THIS philanthropist come from?</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.914" end="00:36:15.114" style="s2">Let&#39;s go get our AC units.</p>
<p begin="00:36:12.214" end="00:36:16.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HURRY UP. LET&#39;S GO.</p>
<p begin="00:36:15.114" end="00:36:18.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SINCE WHEN DOES OUR TOWN have a great</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.714" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">philanthropist?</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.114" end="00:36:20.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.714" end="00:36:24.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go out and take a look, too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.614" end="00:36:26.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:36:24.214" end="00:36:27.725" style="s2">Come, let go see for ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.714" end="00:36:28.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.725" end="00:36:30.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.814" end="00:36:31.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry [screaming] up.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.114" end="00:36:33.514" style="s2">DON&#39;T PUSH. STOP PUSHING.</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.814" end="00:36:36.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, PLEASE, PLEASE, PLEASE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.514" end="00:36:38.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LINE UP. FORM A LINE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:36.614" end="00:36:41.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ONCE I get you all registered,</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.914" end="00:36:45.014" style="s2">every household will get one.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.614" end="00:36:45.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great. YES, AMAZING.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.014" end="00:36:47.016" style="s2">MAYOR,</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.716" end="00:36:48.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THESE AIR conditioners must cost a</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.016" end="00:36:50.016" style="s2">fortune, right?</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.016" end="00:36:51.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is the philanthropist? Quick, let</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.016" end="00:36:51.716" style="s2">us meet him so we can thank him</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.116" end="00:36:52.916" style="s2">properly.</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.716" end="00:36:54.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The philanthropist!</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.916" end="00:36:56.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE PHILANTHROPIST!</p>
<p begin="00:36:54.416" end="00:36:59.716" style="s2">THE PHILANTHROPIST! THE PHILANTHROPIST!</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.916" end="00:37:01.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT, ALL RIGHT.</p>
<p begin="00:36:59.716" end="00:37:03.716" style="s2">This philanthropist originally wanted to</p>
<p begin="00:37:01.716" end="00:37:06.516" style="s2">remain anonymous, but since you&#39;re all</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.716" end="00:37:09.516" style="s2">so passionate, please welcome the</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.516" end="00:37:09.516" style="s2">philanthropist.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.916" end="00:37:22.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow, so handsome. What an entrance.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.316" end="00:37:22.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at that luxury car.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.816" end="00:37:27.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.416" end="00:37:33.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, welcome. Welcome, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.016" end="00:37:38.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey everyone, this is the great</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.916" end="00:37:40.816" style="s2">benefactor of our town, MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.616" end="00:37:41.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELLO, MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.816" end="00:37:45.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILY.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.516" end="00:37:46.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HUH? Isn&#39;t Mr. Vance your new boyfriend?</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.216" end="00:37:47.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He and I</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.016" end="00:37:49.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good day everyone. I have one more thing</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.916" end="00:37:52.016" style="s2">to announce. I am planning to invest</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.916" end="00:37:54.116" style="s2">$200 million in Oak Creek for your local</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.016" end="00:37:56.916" style="s2">schools and infrastructure.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.116" end="00:37:58.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, thank you so much.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.916" end="00:38:00.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $200 million?</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.716" end="00:38:03.716" style="s2">Since when did this Mr. Vance and</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.716" end="00:38:05.416" style="s2">donating become the savior of Oak Creek?</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.716" end="00:38:07.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $200 million?</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.416" end="00:38:10.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, your new boyfriend is no ruthless</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.516" end="00:38:11.316" style="s2">devil. HE IS AN ABSOLUTE SAVIOR.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.416" end="00:38:13.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SAVIOR,</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.316" end="00:38:15.016" style="s2">SAVIOR, SAVIOR.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.216" end="00:38:16.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SAVIOR.</p>
<p begin="00:38:15.016" end="00:38:17.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was these two WHO WERE JUST BAD</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.316" end="00:38:18.616" style="s2">MOUTHING OUR SAVIOR.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.216" end="00:38:21.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WERE YOU TWO SPREADING THOSE LIES?</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.616" end="00:38:23.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO DARES TO INSULT OUR SAVIOR? I, LIAM,</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.416" end="00:38:24.716" style="s2">will be the first to make you pay. LEAVE</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.216" end="00:38:26.516" style="s2">OAK CREEK RIGHT NOW. GET OUT, GET OUT,</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.716" end="00:38:28.216" style="s2">GET OUT OF OAK CREEK. GET OUT, GET OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.516" end="00:38:31.416" style="s2">RUN, GET OUT. IF YOU EVER SPREAD LIES</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.216" end="00:38:31.416" style="s2">AGAIN, WE&#39;LL SET THE DOGS ON YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.616" end="00:38:45.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HELLO NANA. I AM Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.516" end="00:38:46.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.116" end="00:38:48.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, even though I have a massive</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.416" end="00:38:49.817" style="s2">business empire, but we live in a lawful</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.017" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">society now, and all my businesses are</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.817" end="00:38:52.517" style="s2">strictly legitimate.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.717" end="00:38:56.017" style="s2">Nana, Mason Hayes has already abandoned</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.917" end="00:38:57.417" style="s2">Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.017" end="00:39:00.117" style="s2">I love Lily. Please give me your</p>
<p begin="00:38:57.417" end="00:39:01.417" style="s2">blessing to marry her.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.117" end="00:39:03.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance,</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.417" end="00:39:05.617" style="s2">what nonsense are you talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.617" end="00:39:07.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.617" end="00:39:09.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.617" end="00:39:11.517" style="s2">This man looks so fierce and terrifying,</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.817" end="00:39:13.717" style="s2">and he doesn&#39;t even smile.</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.517" end="00:39:16.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I look awful when I smile.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.717" end="00:39:16.617" style="s2">Smile for Nana then.</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.717" end="00:39:18.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.647" end="00:39:22.667" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:39:24.117" end="00:39:28.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a bit better.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.317" end="00:39:29.417" style="s2">You must be He-Man, right?</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.317" end="00:39:31.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henchman.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.417" end="00:39:33.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, can He-Man really fight a grizzly</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.317" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">bear?</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.517" end="00:39:36.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you fight a grizzly bear?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.817" end="00:39:40.517" style="s2">Boss, I really can&#39;t do that.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.517" end="00:39:41.617" style="s2">You can&#39;t just pick on your own</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.517" end="00:39:43.517" style="s2">subordinate.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.617" end="00:39:44.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, grizzly bears are a protected</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.517" end="00:39:45.817" style="s2">species.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.917" end="00:39:48.517" style="s2">Let&#39;s go inside.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.817" end="00:39:50.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, please join us.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.517" end="00:39:52.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh he</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.117" end="00:39:52.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coming, Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.017" end="00:39:59.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, please have a seat.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.317" end="00:40:04.917" style="s2">I&#39;ll go get you some water.</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.017" end="00:40:04.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, I&#39;ll go with you.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.517" end="00:40:10.117" style="s2">What are you doing? Let me go. Nana will</p>
<p begin="00:40:07.717" end="00:40:10.117" style="s2">see us.</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.917" end="00:40:14.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana may be old, but her mind is sharp</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.217" end="00:40:16.717" style="s2">as a tack.</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.617" end="00:40:18.117" style="s2">She&#39;s already promised you to me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.717" end="00:40:21.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What nonsense are you talking about? Why</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.117" end="00:40:21.017" style="s2">are you in Oak Creek?</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.917" end="00:40:26.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, Miss Clark is back in town. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.317" end="00:40:26.717" style="s2">right here.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.457" end="00:40:29.477" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.917" end="00:40:34.917" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.717" end="00:40:36.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t we here to take Miss Clark back?</p>
<p begin="00:40:34.917" end="00:40:38.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t you see she&#39;s crying?</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.628" end="00:40:39.817" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.017" end="00:40:42.217" style="s2">She&#39;s mine. I&#39;m going to comfort her</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.817" end="00:40:42.217" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.417" end="00:40:47.417" style="s2">Answer me first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.917" end="00:40:48.818" style="s2">Why did you run away?</p>
<p begin="00:40:47.417" end="00:40:51.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, we really aren&#39;t right for</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.818" end="00:40:51.218" style="s2">each other.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.918" end="00:40:58.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am furious right now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.818" end="00:41:00.018" style="s2">I can&#39;t hear a word you&#39;re saying. I</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.518" end="00:41:03.118" style="s2">just want to kiss you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.018" end="00:41:03.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, let me go.</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.018" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.918" end="00:41:11.418" style="s2">Let me go. Nana&#39;s calling me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:12.518" end="00:41:17.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll let you go</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.518" end="00:41:17.218" style="s2">if you kiss me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.168" end="00:41:22.918" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.818" end="00:41:25.618" style="s2">Beg me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.918" end="00:41:26.918" style="s2">Seduce me. Kiss me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.618" end="00:41:29.318" style="s2">Do you know how?</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.918" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.318" end="00:41:32.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let Nana see us.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.518" end="00:41:39.418" style="s2">Are you playing with me?</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.218" end="00:41:42.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already kissed you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.418" end="00:41:45.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you even know what a real kiss is?</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.518" end="00:41:45.518" style="s2">If you don&#39;t, I&#39;ll teach you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.618" end="00:42:08.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.718" end="00:42:15.218" style="s2">Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:13.718" end="00:42:17.718" style="s2">Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:15.218" end="00:42:18.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t panic. I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:17.718" end="00:42:20.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.418" end="00:42:21.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.318" end="00:42:23.118" style="s2">Get in here.</p>
<p begin="00:42:21.818" end="00:42:24.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss. Get the car ready. We&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.118" end="00:42:28.218" style="s2">going to the hospital right away.</p>
<p begin="00:42:24.918" end="00:42:28.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, please be okay, NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.018" end="00:42:33.618" style="s2">NANA, WAKE UP, NANA. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.418" end="00:42:33.618" style="s2">NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.318" end="00:42:37.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. VANCE, PLEASE WAIT HERE. WE WILL do</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.818" end="00:42:39.118" style="s2">our best.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.118" end="00:42:41.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:41.218" style="s2">Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.618" end="00:42:44.918" style="s2">Please be okay, Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.518" end="00:42:47.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana will be fine.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.918" end="00:42:47.618" style="s2">You have my word.</p>
<p begin="00:42:50.020" end="00:42:52.420" style="s2">Brother.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.620" end="00:42:57.820" style="s2">I heard you found yourself some trailer</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.920" end="00:43:00.520" style="s2">trash.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.820" end="00:43:00.520" style="s2">Turns out it&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.020" end="00:43:04.820" style="s2">Well, well.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.620" end="00:43:07.320" style="s2">That trailer trash cleans up pretty</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.820" end="00:43:07.320" style="s2">nice.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.120" end="00:43:13.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back off.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.420" end="00:43:15.620" style="s2">Keep staring and you&#39;ll lose those eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.220" end="00:43:15.620" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.120" end="00:43:28.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m actually happy you found a wife,</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.620" end="00:43:30.820" style="s2">brother. After all, nobody has ever</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.520" end="00:43:33.220" style="s2">loved you since we were kids. Mother and</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.820" end="00:43:34.920" style="s2">father always favored me. You only ever</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.220" end="00:43:36.720" style="s2">got my leftovers.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.920" end="00:43:39.320" style="s2">I remember secretly letting a wolf out</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.720" end="00:43:41.995" style="s2">to tear you apart when we were young.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.320" end="00:43:42.620" style="s2">I didn&#39;t expect you to kill it instead.</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.995" end="00:43:44.820" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.620" end="00:43:47.520" style="s2">Oh, by the way, mother and father also</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.820" end="00:43:49.520" style="s2">called you a monster.</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.520" end="00:43:51.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.520" end="00:43:53.320" style="s2">Nobody could ever love a monster like</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.420" end="00:43:57.120" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.320" end="00:43:59.120" style="s2">Does that trailer trash love you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.120" end="00:44:00.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ah, it hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.120" end="00:44:02.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It hurts.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.520" end="00:44:05.820" style="s2">Did you forget how I beat you last time?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.620" end="00:44:05.820" style="s2">How you begged on your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.885" end="00:44:10.720" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.020" end="00:44:14.090" style="s2">Next time you see me, walk the other way</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.720" end="00:44:16.110" style="s2">or I&#39;ll break you every single time.</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.090" end="00:44:16.110" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.320" end="00:44:19.620" style="s2">Watch yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.675" end="00:44:21.220" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.620" end="00:44:23.620" style="s2">You monster.</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.220" end="00:44:27.220" style="s2">I will end you one day.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.620" end="00:44:27.220" style="s2">Your throne belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.720" end="00:44:33.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.720" end="00:44:35.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason? Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.920" end="00:44:37.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.020" end="00:44:37.920" style="s2">Are you still blaming me?</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.920" end="00:44:45.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you show up at the wedding</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.120" end="00:44:45.720" style="s2">reception?</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.420" end="00:44:49.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, please listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.020" end="00:44:50.920" style="s2">I was on my way, but I got into a car</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.520" end="00:44:52.720" style="s2">crash.</p>
<p begin="00:44:50.920" end="00:44:54.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? You</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.720" end="00:44:57.321" style="s2">What what to your arm?</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.221" end="00:44:58.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nothing. Just dislocated.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.321" end="00:45:00.021" style="s2">Then I passed out.</p>
<p begin="00:44:58.921" end="00:45:02.321" style="s2">But the moment I woke up, I came</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.021" end="00:45:03.621" style="s2">straight to find you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.321" end="00:45:05.421" style="s2">Lily,</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.621" end="00:45:07.521" style="s2">give me one more chance.</p>
<p begin="00:45:05.421" end="00:45:10.621" style="s2">Have you forgotten?</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.521" end="00:45:12.321" style="s2">When we were kids, a wolf attacked.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.621" end="00:45:14.221" style="s2">I killed it and saved you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.321" end="00:45:16.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason Hayes killed that wolf and saved</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.221" end="00:45:17.521" style="s2">me. Since that day, I fell in love with</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.921" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.521" end="00:45:20.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.621" end="00:45:28.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance?</p>
<p begin="00:45:25.621" end="00:45:30.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re Mason Hayes?</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.221" end="00:45:30.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.721" end="00:45:36.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.821" end="00:45:41.321" style="s2">I said get on your knees.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.221" end="00:45:45.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you hit him?</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.421" end="00:45:47.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Touch my woman again and I&#39;ll destroy</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.921" end="00:45:49.921" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.221" end="00:45:52.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to hit someone, hit me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.921" end="00:45:55.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re defending him?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.221" end="00:45:55.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love Mason Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.926" end="00:45:58.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.521" end="00:46:00.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily Clark, if you don&#39;t know how to</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.821" end="00:46:02.821" style="s2">speak, keep your mouth shut. Have you</p>
<p begin="00:46:00.721" end="00:46:03.021" style="s2">never seen me lose my temper?</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:06.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.021" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love Mason Hayes, not you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.721" end="00:46:10.221" style="s2">I hope you&#39;ll never bother me again.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.021" end="00:46:14.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.721" end="00:46:16.121" style="s2">I&#39;ll mount him on my wall, then I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.321" end="00:46:18.821" style="s2">have you locked up again and chain you</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.121" end="00:46:20.121" style="s2">to my bed, punishing you day and night.</p>
<p begin="00:46:18.821" end="00:46:21.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.121" end="00:46:23.521" style="s2">You&#39;re a psycho anyway. There&#39;s nothing</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.521" end="00:46:24.921" style="s2">you wouldn&#39;t do.</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.521" end="00:46:26.521" style="s2">Your love is nothing but tyranny and</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.921" end="00:46:29.221" style="s2">possession. You don&#39;t know the first</p>
<p begin="00:46:26.521" end="00:46:29.221" style="s2">THING ABOUT LOVE.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.192" end="00:46:41.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.121" end="00:46:43.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILY CLARK,</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.521" end="00:46:45.121" style="s2">GOOD FOR YOU. I, Alexander Vance, won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.621" end="00:46:46.721" style="s2">die just because you&#39;re gone. If I ever</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.121" end="00:46:49.121" style="s2">come looking for you again, I&#39;m a damn</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.721" end="00:46:51.921" style="s2">stray dog.</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.121" end="00:46:51.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:46:52.821" end="00:46:56.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.921" end="00:47:00.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.422" end="00:47:03.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.622" end="00:47:06.723" style="s2">Nana.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.723" end="00:47:06.723" style="s2">Nana, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.622" end="00:47:13.723" style="s2">Doctor, how is my Nana doing?</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.323" end="00:47:15.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing you brought her in time. The</p>
<p begin="00:47:13.723" end="00:47:16.223" style="s2">patient is currently stable.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.527" end="00:47:18.323" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.223" end="00:47:19.323" style="s2">However, she needs surgery immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.323" end="00:47:21.122" style="s2">You need to prepare half a million</p>
<p begin="00:47:19.323" end="00:47:23.387" style="s2">dollars for the surgical fee. Go prepare</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.122" end="00:47:24.823" style="s2">the money quickly. Go.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.387" end="00:47:26.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.823" end="00:47:28.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half a million dollars?</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.622" end="00:47:29.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, I have half a million dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.223" end="00:47:32.323" style="s2">I&#39;ll go get the money right now.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.922" end="00:47:32.323" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.723" end="00:47:40.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.622" end="00:47:44.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm?</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.622" end="00:47:44.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mason, is it done?</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.277" end="00:47:50.823" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.122" end="00:47:53.122" style="s2">That idiot Lily actually sell out with</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.823" end="00:47:54.622" style="s2">Alexander Vance for me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.122" end="00:47:55.922" style="s2">Now she&#39;s still in the hospital waiting</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.622" end="00:47:57.422" style="s2">for me to bring her the half a million</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.922" end="00:48:00.122" style="s2">dollars.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.422" end="00:48:03.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let her wait. Wait until that damn</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.122" end="00:48:03.422" style="s2">old hag is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.723" end="00:48:12.323" style="s2">Mason, I&#39;ve suspected you for a long</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.023" end="00:48:14.823" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.323" end="00:48:16.023" style="s2">I didn&#39;t alert you back in the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.823" end="00:48:17.323" style="s2">because I wanted to see your true</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.023" end="00:48:20.922" style="s2">colors.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.323" end="00:48:23.523" style="s2">So you and Chloe are in this together.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.922" end="00:48:25.122" style="s2">Vance finally dumped Lily.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.523" end="00:48:28.922" style="s2">Mason,</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.122" end="00:48:28.922" style="s2">I think Lily really fell for you.</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.023" end="00:48:32.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s because she thinks the one who</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.323" end="00:48:34.128" style="s2">killed the wolf and saved her</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.922" end="00:48:34.823" style="s2">was me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.128" end="00:48:36.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.823" end="00:48:39.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does that mean? She got the wrong</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.823" end="00:48:43.122" style="s2">guy. The one who fought off that wolf</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.023" end="00:48:43.122" style="s2">wasn&#39;t you. It was someone else.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.622" end="00:48:48.122" style="s2">I got the wrong guy?</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.422" end="00:48:49.023" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t Mason? It was never Mason,</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.122" end="00:48:50.823" style="s2">that liar.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.023" end="00:48:53.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily is just some trailer trash. She</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.823" end="00:48:53.823" style="s2">never deserved me anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.223" end="00:48:58.122" style="s2">It&#39;s a shame we couldn&#39;t just sell her</p>
<p begin="00:48:55.323" end="00:49:00.224" style="s2">off at the wedding banquet.</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.122" end="00:49:01.724" style="s2">I I you get your revenge this time.</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.224" end="00:49:02.924" style="s2">How will you reward me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.724" end="00:49:05.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The room?</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.924" end="00:49:05.824" style="s2">I&#39;ve already booked it.</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.188" end="00:49:12.124" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.153" end="00:49:15.024" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.124" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">Why is this happening?</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.024" end="00:49:18.724" style="s2">I had the wrong person all along.</p>
<p begin="00:49:19.524" end="00:49:21.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NONA.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.824" end="00:49:25.524" style="s2">NONA,</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.624" end="00:49:25.524" style="s2">WHERE ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.024" end="00:49:52.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MISTER, THERE&#39;S A WOLF.</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.324" end="00:49:52.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.554" end="00:50:04.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.484" end="00:50:08.504" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.424" end="00:50:26.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for saving me, mister.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.924" end="00:50:28.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wolf was after me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.524" end="00:50:30.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mister, you&#39;re bleeding. Let me take you</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.624" end="00:50:31.624" style="s2">to the hospital.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.524" end="00:50:33.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.624" end="00:50:35.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not?</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.424" end="00:50:36.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My parents and my brother, they don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.324" end="00:50:39.324" style="s2">love me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.424" end="00:50:41.424" style="s2">Nobody in this world loves me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.324" end="00:50:44.224" style="s2">Being alone is too hard.</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.424" end="00:50:45.424" style="s2">I&#39;d rather just die and end it all.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.224" end="00:50:49.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mister,</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.424" end="00:50:51.224" style="s2">if nobody in the world loves you,</p>
<p begin="00:50:49.024" end="00:50:54.624" style="s2">then I will love you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.224" end="00:50:54.624" style="s2">Let&#39;s make a pinky promise.</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.524" end="00:51:03.025" style="s2">Pinky promise, and it lasts forever.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.324" end="00:51:04.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUNG MASTER,</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.025" end="00:51:05.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUNG MASTER.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.325" end="00:51:08.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HURRY, GET THE YOUNG MASTER TO THE</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.525" end="00:51:08.425" style="s2">HOSPITAL. LET&#39;S GO.</p>
<p begin="00:51:09.325" end="00:51:12.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LILY.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.625" end="00:51:23.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.725" end="00:51:27.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.325" end="00:51:29.325" style="s2">We made a pinky promise when we were</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.825" end="00:51:31.925" style="s2">little.</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.325" end="00:51:33.225" style="s2">I promised I&#39;d always love you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.925" end="00:51:35.825" style="s2">But now</p>
<p begin="00:51:33.225" end="00:51:39.495" style="s2">I gave it to the wrong person.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.825" end="00:51:41.515" style="s2">Where are you now? Are you doing okay?</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.495" end="00:51:41.515" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.625" end="00:51:45.125" style="s2">Is there anyone who loves you?</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.425" end="00:51:52.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get this old hag out of here right now.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.725" end="00:51:54.125" style="s2">This VIP suite is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.525" end="00:51:56.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.125" end="00:51:58.490" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing? Let go OF MY NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.325" end="00:51:59.625" style="s2">WHY ARE YOU TOUCHING HER?</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.490" end="00:52:01.425" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.625" end="00:52:02.825" style="s2">NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.425" end="00:52:04.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect timing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:02.825" end="00:52:07.125" style="s2">Pack your trash. Clear this room right</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.925" end="00:52:09.325" style="s2">now. I&#39;m taking it.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.125" end="00:52:11.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On what grounds? This is my Nana&#39;s room.</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.325" end="00:52:12.425" style="s2">Why should we give it to you?</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.591" end="00:52:14.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.425" end="00:52:17.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On what grounds? Word on the street is</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.925" end="00:52:18.325" style="s2">you haven&#39;t even paid the surgery bill.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.025" end="00:52:19.425" style="s2">Look at you, straight out of the trailer</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.325" end="00:52:22.225" style="s2">park.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.425" end="00:52:23.625" style="s2">You broke rat?</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.225" end="00:52:26.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will find a way to pay the hospital</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.625" end="00:52:27.725" style="s2">bill myself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.125" end="00:52:29.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever. If you have no money, just</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.725" end="00:52:31.525" style="s2">wait to die.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.725" end="00:52:33.725" style="s2">Do you even know who I am?</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.525" end="00:52:35.425" style="s2">I am Tyson.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.725" end="00:52:36.925" style="s2">What&#39;s this? I&#39;ve got more money than</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.425" end="00:52:38.625" style="s2">you could ever dream of. YOU WANT IT?</p>
<p begin="00:52:36.925" end="00:52:39.125" style="s2">YOU TRAILER TRASH EVER SEEN THIS MUCH?</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.625" end="00:52:40.225" style="s2">HUH? HUH?</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.125" end="00:52:41.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DOES HAVING money mean you can do</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.225" end="00:52:45.425" style="s2">WHATEVER YOU WANT?</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.925" end="00:52:46.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAMN RIGHT IT DOES. I&#39;VE GOT THE CASH.</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.425" end="00:52:47.425" style="s2">WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR? THROW THE OLD</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.825" end="00:52:48.925" style="s2">HAG OUT.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.425" end="00:52:51.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES, SIR. RIGHT AWAY.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.925" end="00:52:52.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NANA. DON&#39;T TOUCH MY NANA. YOU</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.525" end="00:52:54.325" style="s2">NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.825" end="00:52:56.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T LISTEN TO HER. DO IT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.325" end="00:52:56.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.825" end="00:53:01.925" style="s2">NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:52:58.725" end="00:53:01.925" style="s2">GET [screaming] OUT OF MY WAY.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.025" end="00:53:07.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WELL, WELL.</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.125" end="00:53:09.127" style="s2">UP</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.327" end="00:53:11.627" style="s2">YOU&#39;RE not bad looking at all. Much</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.127" end="00:53:13.161" style="s2">better than those city girls. So sweet</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.627" end="00:53:15.027" style="s2">and fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.161" end="00:53:16.027" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.027" end="00:53:17.827" style="s2">Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.027" end="00:53:20.327" style="s2">how about this?</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.827" end="00:53:22.327" style="s2">I&#39;ll pay off Nana&#39;s medical bills.</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.327" end="00:53:23.927" style="s2">Let our Nana rest up here comfortably.</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.327" end="00:53:27.327" style="s2">What do you say?</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.927" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In your dreams. Move. Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.327" end="00:53:30.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t push your luck.</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.627" end="00:53:34.327" style="s2">You should feel lucky I even want you.</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.027" end="00:53:42.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NANA. NANA.</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.927" end="00:53:42.527" style="s2">DOCTOR. [screaming] DOCTOR.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.257" end="00:53:47.277" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.927" end="00:53:51.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FEISTY LITTLE THING, AREN&#39;T YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.527" end="00:53:53.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU WANT?</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.927" end="00:53:54.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re going to pay FOR THAT RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.427" end="00:53:56.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:53:54.427" end="00:53:56.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.427" end="00:54:13.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.027" end="00:54:13.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT IS IT? GETTING BULLIED AGAIN?</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.427" end="00:54:22.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who the hell are you?</p>
<p begin="00:54:20.127" end="00:54:24.527" style="s2">Playing the hero, huh? You messed UP MY</p>
<p begin="00:54:22.227" end="00:54:25.627" style="s2">BUSINESS. NOW GET LOST.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.527" end="00:54:28.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE THE FIRST ONE WHO DARED TO tell</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.627" end="00:54:31.107" style="s2">me to get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.227" end="00:54:33.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You talk PRETTY BIG. GO TO HELL.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.107" end="00:54:33.127" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.727" end="00:54:44.027" style="s2">WHAT?</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.827" end="00:54:44.027" style="s2">GET DOWN ON THE GROUND.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.827" end="00:54:48.927" style="s2">WHO THE HELL ARE YOU PEOPLE?</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.127" end="00:54:56.627" style="s2">I&#39;M TYSON. I&#39;M LOADED. LET ME TELL YOU,</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.927" end="00:54:59.273" style="s2">IF YOU TOUCH ME TODAY, NONE OF YOU WILL</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.627" end="00:55:00.827" style="s2">GET AWAY WITH THIS.</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.273" end="00:55:02.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.827" end="00:55:03.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU DARE TO COMPARE WEALTH WITH ME?</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.327" end="00:55:06.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU&#39;RE messing with the wrong person.</p>
<p begin="00:55:03.527" end="00:55:06.527" style="s2">You got a death wish?</p>
<p begin="00:55:12.628" end="00:55:16.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Open your damn eyes and look at this.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.428" end="00:55:21.928" style="s2">This this</p>
<p begin="00:55:20.528" end="00:55:24.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just had to throw yourself into the line</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.928" end="00:55:25.528" style="s2">of fire. I may not have much else, but</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.028" end="00:55:28.428" style="s2">what I do have is money.</p>
<p begin="00:55:25.528" end="00:55:30.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IMPOSSIBLE. WHO THE HELL ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.428" end="00:55:34.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IN THE WHOLE CITY</p>
<p begin="00:55:30.328" end="00:55:35.928" style="s2">EXCEPT THE ruthless billionaire CEO</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.428" end="00:55:38.228" style="s2">Mr. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.928" end="00:55:41.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO ONE ELSE IS RICHER THAN ME. WHO</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.228" end="00:55:42.928" style="s2">EXACTLY ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.328" end="00:55:47.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LISTEN TO ME CAREFULLY.</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.928" end="00:55:47.128" style="s2">I am Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.398" end="00:55:50.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.428" end="00:55:53.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.828" end="00:55:55.128" style="s2">MR. VANCE. MR. VANCE. MR. VANCE, I WAS</p>
<p begin="00:55:53.728" end="00:55:57.428" style="s2">WRONG.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.128" end="00:56:00.928" style="s2">MR. VANCE, I WAS BLIND. PLEASE SPARE ME</p>
<p begin="00:55:57.428" end="00:56:00.928" style="s2">THIS ONCE, MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.928" end="00:56:04.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he just touch you?</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.028" end="00:56:10.128" style="s2">Dare touch my woman?</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.128" end="00:56:14.628" style="s2">You have a death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.428" end="00:56:16.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, PLEASE SPARE ME. MR. VANCE,</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.628" end="00:56:18.828" style="s2">PLEASE LET ME GO.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.928" end="00:56:22.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is no time for violence.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.828" end="00:56:23.228" style="s2">Consider this your medical expenses.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.028" end="00:56:26.428" style="s2">I never want to see you in this city</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.228" end="00:56:26.428" style="s2">again. Get lost.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.728" end="00:56:31.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, SAVE ME. MR. VANCE. MR.</p>
<p begin="00:56:32.284" end="00:56:36.428" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.828" end="00:56:37.928" style="s2">DOCTOR DOCTOR DOCTOR.</p>
<p begin="00:56:36.428" end="00:56:40.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HENCHMAN, get the doctor.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.928" end="00:56:40.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:56:44.328" end="00:56:47.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The patient&#39;s vitals are stable. Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.928" end="00:56:49.528" style="s2">serious. Don&#39;t worry. However, the</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.628" end="00:56:50.628" style="s2">patient urgently needs surgery.</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.528" end="00:56:52.589" style="s2">You need to prepare the surgery fee</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.628" end="00:56:54.609" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.589" end="00:56:54.609" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.728" end="00:56:59.228" style="s2">Do you need money?</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.528" end="00:56:59.228" style="s2">I have plenty.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.428" end="00:57:03.028" style="s2">Do you want it?</p>
<p begin="00:57:07.328" end="00:57:11.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance,</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.828" end="00:57:13.829" style="s2">thank you for saving me just now.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.729" end="00:57:15.129" style="s2">But I can&#39;t take your money.</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.829" end="00:57:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.129" end="00:57:18.129" style="s2">Are you still waiting for that boyfriend</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.429" end="00:57:19.729" style="s2">of yours?</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.129" end="00:57:20.929" style="s2">He disappears whenever you actually need</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.729" end="00:57:22.929" style="s2">help.</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.929" end="00:57:25.029" style="s2">What exactly do you see in him?</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.929" end="00:57:28.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t like Mason Hayes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.029" end="00:57:29.829" style="s2">I need to find the boy who saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.329" end="00:57:31.889" style="s2">I&#39;ll figure out a way to pay for Nana&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.829" end="00:57:34.929" style="s2">medical bills myself.</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.889" end="00:57:34.929" style="s2">[gasps] I&#39;m going to make a call.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.129" end="00:57:39.529" style="s2">Hello, Mrs. Miller?</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.439" end="00:57:41.059" style="s2">[snorts] Can you help me sell the old</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.529" end="00:57:41.829" style="s2">house in Oak Creek?</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.059" end="00:57:44.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.829" end="00:57:46.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, why are you selling the old house?</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.329" end="00:57:47.029" style="s2">If you sell it, where will you and Nana</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.129" end="00:57:48.929" style="s2">live?</p>
<p begin="00:57:47.029" end="00:57:52.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Miller, I need the money urgently</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.929" end="00:57:53.505" style="s2">right now. Please just help me sell it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.129" end="00:57:54.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.505" end="00:57:56.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.429" end="00:57:59.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to cure Nana first, and then I</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.629" end="00:58:02.829" style="s2">will go find the boy who saved me.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.329" end="00:58:02.829" style="s2">I won&#39;t let him be alone anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:58:04.629" end="00:58:08.929" style="s2">Nana? Where is my Nana?</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.029" end="00:58:11.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Clark, your Nana has been taken</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.929" end="00:58:13.129" style="s2">away by my boss.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.429" end="00:58:14.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did he take my Nana? Are you</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.129" end="00:58:17.129" style="s2">kidnappers?</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.729" end="00:58:19.629" style="s2">Where is my Nana? I want to see her!</p>
<p begin="00:58:17.129" end="00:58:21.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down, Mrs. Clark. You need to go</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.629" end="00:58:22.729" style="s2">beg my boss.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.529" end="00:58:25.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is he?</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.729" end="00:58:25.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.929" end="00:58:36.829" style="s2">Boss, Ms. Clark is here.</p>
<p begin="00:58:33.929" end="00:58:36.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is my Nana?</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.429" end="00:58:41.929" style="s2">MR. VANCE, WHERE IS MY NANA? I need to</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.529" end="00:58:43.129" style="s2">see her!</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.929" end="00:58:45.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here</p>
<p begin="00:58:43.129" end="00:58:45.729" style="s2">and beg me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.729" end="00:58:52.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why should I beg you?</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.729" end="00:58:58.529" style="s2">What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.429" end="00:59:04.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Nana&#39;s life is in my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.629" end="00:59:06.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander Vance, let me go!</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.529" end="00:59:07.929" style="s2">Nana is getting older and she needs this</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.329" end="00:59:08.929" style="s2">surgery. She&#39;s the only family I have</p>
<p begin="00:59:07.929" end="00:59:10.729" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.929" end="00:59:12.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you have to beg me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.729" end="00:59:14.731" style="s2">Why can&#39;t you ever just behave?</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.929" end="00:59:16.631" style="s2">The less you behave, the more excited I</p>
<p begin="00:59:14.731" end="00:59:19.631" style="s2">get. If you had just behaved, maybe I</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.631" end="00:59:20.931" style="s2">would have gotten bored of you by now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.631" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.931" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">I beg you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.931" end="00:59:30.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this how you beg?</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.731" end="00:59:30.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly do you want from me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:30.331" end="00:59:33.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I want?</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.131" end="00:59:36.831" style="s2">It&#39;s simple.</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.931" end="00:59:36.831" style="s2">I just want you.</p>
<p begin="00:59:42.236" end="00:59:46.331" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.831" end="00:59:49.231" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you want to beg me?</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.331" end="00:59:50.931" style="s2">Then do it my favorite way.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.231" end="00:59:53.531" style="s2">Lie beneath me</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.931" end="00:59:53.531" style="s2">and beg.</p>
<p begin="00:59:54.131" end="00:59:57.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want this.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.031" end="00:59:57.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="01:00:07.431" end="01:00:10.731" style="s2">Do you still want to see your Nana?</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.431" end="01:00:18.331" style="s2">Don&#39;t call me Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.531" end="01:00:19.931" style="s2">Call me something else.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.331" end="01:00:22.191" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call you what?</p>
<p begin="01:00:19.931" end="01:00:23.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like the first time you saw me.</p>
<p begin="01:00:22.191" end="01:00:25.131" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.431" end="01:00:27.831" style="s2">Call me husband.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.131" end="01:00:27.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:00:31.731" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you will never see your Nana again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.731" end="01:00:38.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.131" end="01:00:44.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say it.</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.131" end="01:00:44.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband.</p>
<p begin="01:00:48.131" end="01:00:52.131" style="s2">Mr. Vance, Nana is the only family I</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.631" end="01:00:53.431" style="s2">have left.</p>
<p begin="01:00:52.131" end="01:00:55.731" style="s2">Please, can you just give her back to</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.431" end="01:00:55.731" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.231" end="01:01:00.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could do that,</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.031" end="01:01:03.231" style="s2">but you have to agree to one condition.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.631" end="01:01:03.231" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What condition?</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.112" end="01:01:06.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:07.331" end="01:01:11.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spend the rest of your life with me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:09.131" end="01:01:11.631" style="s2">Marry me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:13.132" end="01:01:15.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marriage?</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.522" end="01:01:20.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.232" end="01:01:22.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Marry me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.332" end="01:01:23.762" style="s2">Be Mrs. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:01:22.032" end="01:01:25.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.762" end="01:01:25.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.532" end="01:01:30.967" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.132" end="01:01:31.232" style="s2">You don&#39;t have a choice.</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.967" end="01:01:33.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.232" end="01:01:35.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to me. I will never marry you in</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.232" end="01:01:37.632" style="s2">my entire life. I already have someone I</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.232" end="01:01:37.632" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.332" end="01:01:41.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t care if you love someone else.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.932" end="01:01:49.232" style="s2">If I can&#39;t be the one in your heart,</p>
<p begin="01:01:45.932" end="01:01:49.232" style="s2">then I&#39;ll be the one on top of you.</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.032" end="01:01:55.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a maniac.</p>
<p begin="01:01:53.832" end="01:01:56.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.332" end="01:01:57.822" style="s2">Are you willing to gamble with Nana&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.532" end="01:01:57.832" style="s2">life?</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.822" end="01:01:59.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.832" end="01:02:02.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My savior?</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.432" end="01:02:02.432" style="s2">I can&#39;t lose Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.132" end="01:02:08.532" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:02:05.932" end="01:02:08.532" style="s2">I&#39;ll marry you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.132" end="01:02:12.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the car. We&#39;re going to City Hall.</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.432" end="01:02:15.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, right now?</p>
<p begin="01:02:12.732" end="01:02:15.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, right now.</p>
<p begin="01:02:23.532" end="01:02:27.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I actually married Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.932" end="01:02:29.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.532" end="01:02:31.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations, MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="01:02:29.432" end="01:02:33.232" style="s2">CONGRATULATIONS, MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.232" end="01:02:34.832" style="s2">CONGRATULATIONS, MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.232" end="01:02:35.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER, WE&#39;RE already married. I want</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.832" end="01:02:37.632" style="s2">to see Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.732" end="01:02:41.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. Nana is doing perfectly</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.632" end="01:02:41.632" style="s2">fine. Let&#39;s go. We&#39;re heading back.</p>
<p begin="01:02:43.832" end="01:02:47.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You broke your promise.</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.632" end="01:02:49.132" style="s2">I will never trust you again.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.532" end="01:02:50.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did I break my promise?</p>
<p begin="01:02:49.132" end="01:02:51.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the hospital, you said you wouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.332" end="01:02:53.032" style="s2">come looking for me anymore. Why are you</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.932" end="01:02:54.432" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="01:02:53.032" end="01:02:55.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Do you own this hospital or</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.432" end="01:02:58.132" style="s2">something?</p>
<p begin="01:02:55.432" end="01:02:59.432" style="s2">I come back whenever I want to.</p>
<p begin="01:02:58.132" end="01:03:00.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said whoever came back would be a</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.432" end="01:03:02.668" style="s2">dog.</p>
<p begin="01:03:00.532" end="01:03:03.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I am a dog.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.668" end="01:03:05.332" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:03:03.532" end="01:03:06.832" style="s2">Do you prefer a fierce guard dog or a</p>
<p begin="01:03:05.332" end="01:03:08.132" style="s2">cute little puppy?</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.832" end="01:03:10.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, this is</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.132" end="01:03:13.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want me to bark for you?</p>
<p begin="01:03:10.632" end="01:03:13.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, please don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:03:14.632" end="01:03:19.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Psycho.</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.078" end="01:03:19.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.132" end="01:03:24.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come here. Come here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.333" end="01:03:25.633" style="s2">Go smash that dog cage we bought. Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.233" end="01:03:27.333" style="s2">I&#39;m afraid the boss might get too into</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.633" end="01:03:29.033" style="s2">character and crawl into the cage to</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.333" end="01:03:30.933" style="s2">entertain madam.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.033" end="01:03:32.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to see Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.933" end="01:03:34.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana is doing just fine now. Not only</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.933" end="01:03:36.133" style="s2">will I ensure she lives a long life, I</p>
<p begin="01:03:34.633" end="01:03:38.233" style="s2">will also provide her with the best care</p>
<p begin="01:03:36.133" end="01:03:40.533" style="s2">in her old age. Let&#39;s go. Time to go</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.233" end="01:03:40.533" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.833" end="01:03:50.533" style="s2">Madam, please.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.933" end="01:03:57.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This place is huge.</p>
<p begin="01:03:58.033" end="01:04:02.333" style="s2">You live here?</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.733" end="01:04:02.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We live here.</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.584" end="01:04:05.604" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.633" end="01:04:17.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:04:20.833" end="01:04:24.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are these people?</p>
<p begin="01:04:22.533" end="01:04:26.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam, these people were specifically</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.633" end="01:04:29.233" style="s2">assigned by the boss to take care of</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.533" end="01:04:31.633" style="s2">your daily needs.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.233" end="01:04:32.433" style="s2">Listen up. From now on, if madam is</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.633" end="01:04:33.333" style="s2">hungry,</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.433" end="01:04:34.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We cook.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.333" end="01:04:35.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If madam is thirsty,</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.533" end="01:04:37.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We pour water.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.933" end="01:04:38.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If there are any mistakes, you&#39;ll answer</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.833" end="01:04:39.433" style="s2">to me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.433" end="01:04:41.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.433" end="01:04:42.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have hands and feet. I don&#39;t need</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.033" end="01:04:45.133" style="s2">anyone waiting on me.</p>
<p begin="01:04:42.633" end="01:04:46.433" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You might not, but my wife does.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.133" end="01:04:48.433" style="s2">I want to give my wife the best in the</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.433" end="01:04:50.233" style="s2">world.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.433" end="01:04:54.033" style="s2">Take madam to her room to rest.</p>
<p begin="01:04:50.233" end="01:04:54.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir. Right this way, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.733" end="01:05:00.733" style="s2">Please come in, madam.</p>
<p begin="01:05:02.933" end="01:05:06.533" style="s2">Thank you. Madam, I&#39;ll draw a bath for</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.033" end="01:05:08.433" style="s2">you so you and Mr. Vance can get some</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.533" end="01:05:10.133" style="s2">rest early.</p>
<p begin="01:05:08.433" end="01:05:12.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance is sleeping here too?</p>
<p begin="01:05:10.133" end="01:05:14.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Mr. Vance will be with his</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.033" end="01:05:16.433" style="s2">wife. After all, tonight is your wedding</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.033" end="01:05:16.433" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.535" end="01:05:37.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Been waiting for me.</p>
<p begin="01:05:35.435" end="01:05:40.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.835" end="01:05:42.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you afraid of me?</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.535" end="01:05:42.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.635" end="01:05:54.335" style="s2">Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:05:51.035" end="01:05:56.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forgot what you&#39;re supposed to call me?</p>
<p begin="01:05:54.335" end="01:05:58.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Husband.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.245" end="01:05:58.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:06:00.335" end="01:06:04.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.835" end="01:06:08.435" style="s2">Not willing?</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.335" end="01:06:08.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it even matter what I want?</p>
<p begin="01:06:17.860" end="01:06:19.880" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.735" end="01:06:28.335" style="s2">Get it over with.</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.635" end="01:06:30.335" style="s2">Isn&#39;t this what you wanted?</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.335" end="01:06:33.335" style="s2">But you said</p>
<p begin="01:06:30.335" end="01:06:33.335" style="s2">if I was a good girl,</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.535" end="01:06:36.735" style="s2">you&#39;d let Nana and me go.</p>
<p begin="01:06:36.835" end="01:06:41.435" style="s2">I&#39;m being good now.</p>
<p begin="01:06:39.735" end="01:06:43.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you that in love with Mason Hayes?</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.435" end="01:06:46.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never loved him.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.635" end="01:06:46.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who?</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.035" end="01:06:51.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who I love?</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.135" end="01:06:52.535" style="s2">Do you really want to know?</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.235" end="01:06:53.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.535" end="01:06:55.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:53.835" end="01:06:56.235" style="s2">The one I&#39;ve loved since I was a little</p>
<p begin="01:06:55.335" end="01:06:58.235" style="s2">girl</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.235" end="01:07:01.535" style="s2">is the boy who saved my life, the one</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.235" end="01:07:01.535" style="s2">who beat a wolf to death for me.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.435" end="01:07:05.435" style="s2">I&#39;m telling you, when I was little, the</p>
<p begin="01:07:04.835" end="01:07:06.935" style="s2">person I</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.435" end="01:07:08.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. I don&#39;t want to hear it. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.935" end="01:07:10.635" style="s2">care.</p>
<p begin="01:07:08.335" end="01:07:12.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He must be so lonely right now.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.635" end="01:07:13.935" style="s2">He&#39;s all alone in this world just</p>
<p begin="01:07:12.135" end="01:07:15.535" style="s2">waiting for me to love him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.935" end="01:07:16.635" style="s2">If it weren&#39;t for me, no one would ever</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.535" end="01:07:18.135" style="s2">love him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:16.635" end="01:07:19.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I told you that I&#39;m all alone,</p>
<p begin="01:07:18.135" end="01:07:20.935" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.135" end="01:07:23.235" style="s2">That I&#39;m just as lonely.</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.935" end="01:07:25.236" style="s2">In this world, no one loves me either.</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.235" end="01:07:26.936" style="s2">Can&#39;t you just show a little mercy</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.236" end="01:07:28.636" style="s2">and love me a little?</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.936" end="01:07:30.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is that possible?</p>
<p begin="01:07:28.636" end="01:07:33.836" style="s2">You are the almighty, ruthless,</p>
<p begin="01:07:30.236" end="01:07:33.836" style="s2">all-powerful Alexander Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:07:40.136" end="01:07:42.736" style="s2">Bring it on.</p>
<p begin="01:07:54.536" end="01:07:57.136" style="s2">What are you trying to do now?</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.736" end="01:07:58.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can wait.</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.136" end="01:08:00.236" style="s2">I&#39;ll wait until you give yourself to me</p>
<p begin="01:07:58.336" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">willingly.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.236" end="01:08:05.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He actually didn&#39;t touch me.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.236" end="01:08:07.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No matter who you love right now, as</p>
<p begin="01:08:05.436" end="01:08:08.536" style="s2">long as you stay by my side and be a</p>
<p begin="01:08:07.136" end="01:08:09.936" style="s2">good wife,</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.536" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">I believe you will fall in love with me</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.936" end="01:08:12.536" style="s2">eventually.</p>
<p begin="01:08:18.336" end="01:08:23.036" style="s2">I&#39;ll sleep in the guest room.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.136" end="01:08:23.036" style="s2">Good night, my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.136" end="01:08:34.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.436" end="01:08:36.936" style="s2">your brother is here again.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.436" end="01:08:39.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother, it&#39;s your wedding day, so I</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.936" end="01:08:40.736" style="s2">came to congratulate you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.436" end="01:08:42.036" style="s2">But wait a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:08:40.736" end="01:08:44.136" style="s2">Tonight is supposed to be your wedding</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.036" end="01:08:46.736" style="s2">night with that trailer trash. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.136" end="01:08:49.136" style="s2">wrong? Did she kick you out? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.736" end="01:08:51.536" style="s2">I knew it. Just like I said, in this</p>
<p begin="01:08:49.136" end="01:08:54.836" style="s2">world, absolutely no one loves you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:51.536" end="01:08:54.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SAY THAT ONE MORE TIME.</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.736" end="01:08:58.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BROTHER,</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.836" end="01:09:00.536" style="s2">mother and father don&#39;t love you. And</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.836" end="01:09:02.236" style="s2">even though you&#39;re married now, your own</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.536" end="01:09:03.577" style="s2">wife doesn&#39;t love you either. Look at</p>
<p begin="01:09:02.236" end="01:09:05.597" style="s2">you, HOW PATHETIC.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.577" end="01:09:05.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:09:13.136" end="01:09:17.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU HIT ME AGAIN.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.936" end="01:09:18.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OUR BOSS HITS you whenever he pleases.</p>
<p begin="01:09:17.036" end="01:09:19.836" style="s2">Do you expect him to check his schedule</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.336" end="01:09:21.836" style="s2">first?</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.836" end="01:09:23.336" style="s2">I happen to be in a terrible mood today,</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.836" end="01:09:24.836" style="s2">and you just handed yourself over as a</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.336" end="01:09:28.036" style="s2">punching bag.</p>
<p begin="01:09:24.836" end="01:09:28.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU JUST WAIT AND SEE.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.123" end="01:09:31.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.742" end="01:09:35.637" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.338" end="01:09:38.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT MONSTER HIT SO HARD.</p>
<p begin="01:09:35.637" end="01:09:39.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MR. JULIAN, what should we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.338" end="01:09:41.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t expect my brother to actually</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.838" end="01:09:44.137" style="s2">marry that trailer trash.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.637" end="01:09:45.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seems like he really cares about her.</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.137" end="01:09:47.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The trailer trash doesn&#39;t care about</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.538" end="01:09:47.938" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.137" end="01:09:50.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:09:59.538" end="01:10:02.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to go see Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.838" end="01:10:07.438" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, Mr. Julian is here.</p>
<p begin="01:10:08.738" end="01:10:12.038" style="s2">He&#39;s Alexander&#39;s brother.</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.438" end="01:10:18.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:10:19.137" end="01:10:22.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, your brother isn&#39;t home today.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.137" end="01:10:24.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.137" end="01:10:25.838" style="s2">I came to see you.</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.038" end="01:10:28.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.838" end="01:10:28.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to make a deal.</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.738" end="01:10:32.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of deal?</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.938" end="01:10:38.538" style="s2">What is this?</p>
<p begin="01:10:38.938" end="01:10:41.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a boat ticket.</p>
<p begin="01:10:42.637" end="01:10:46.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this supposed to mean?</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.738" end="01:10:47.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve heard everything.</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.137" end="01:10:49.137" style="s2">You don&#39;t even like my brother.</p>
<p begin="01:10:47.938" end="01:10:51.238" style="s2">It was my brother who threatened your</p>
<p begin="01:10:49.137" end="01:10:52.938" style="s2">Nana and forced you into marrying him.</p>
<p begin="01:10:51.238" end="01:10:54.538" style="s2">Now, you can take this boat ticket and</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.938" end="01:10:56.238" style="s2">leave. Don&#39;t worry. My brother will</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.538" end="01:10:57.938" style="s2">never find you. All right, and rest</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.238" end="01:11:00.038" style="s2">assured about your Nana. Once you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:10:57.938" end="01:11:01.938" style="s2">gone, I&#39;ll send her to reunite with you</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.038" end="01:11:03.338" style="s2">right away.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.938" end="01:11:05.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.338" end="01:11:07.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because my brother likes you, and I want</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.538" end="01:11:10.137" style="s2">to take away everything he likes and</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.738" end="01:11:11.838" style="s2">leave him with absolutely nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.137" end="01:11:12.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law, don&#39;t worry about all</p>
<p begin="01:11:11.838" end="01:11:14.338" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.738" end="01:11:17.338" style="s2">Don&#39;t you want to escape his control and</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.338" end="01:11:17.338" style="s2">regain your freedom?</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.938" end="01:11:21.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do want to leave him, but I will never</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.938" end="01:11:23.438" style="s2">cooperate with you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.637" end="01:11:27.538" style="s2">Your brother may not be a good person,</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.438" end="01:11:27.538" style="s2">but I can tell you are much worse.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.938" end="01:11:31.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do I look like a bad guy?</p>
<p begin="01:11:32.239" end="01:11:35.339" style="s2">Sister in law, I heard there is someone</p>
<p begin="01:11:34.139" end="01:11:38.339" style="s2">you like.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.339" end="01:11:38.339" style="s2">Don&#39;t you want to go find him?</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.439" end="01:11:46.739" style="s2">Think about it sister in law, I&#39;ll wait</p>
<p begin="01:11:44.139" end="01:11:46.739" style="s2">for your answer.</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.239" end="01:11:53.879" style="s2">I heard my brother was here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:52.539" end="01:11:55.899" style="s2">What did he tell you?</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.879" end="01:11:55.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.939" end="01:12:03.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The plum blossom birth mark.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.739" end="01:12:03.739" style="s2">The boy who saved me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.039" end="01:12:10.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did he tell you?</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.239" end="01:12:12.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.739" end="01:12:14.439" style="s2">I must have seen it wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.639" end="01:12:16.139" style="s2">Alexander couldn&#39;t be the boy who saved</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.439" end="01:12:18.539" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.139" end="01:12:20.339" style="s2">Nothing, he was just looking for you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.539" end="01:12:21.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t let him come here again.</p>
<p begin="01:12:20.339" end="01:12:23.139" style="s2">And next time you don&#39;t have to wake up</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.739" end="01:12:24.539" style="s2">this early.</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.139" end="01:12:26.539" style="s2">Marrying into this family, you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.539" end="01:12:28.139" style="s2">have to wait on any parents in laws and</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.539" end="01:12:29.739" style="s2">there&#39;s no extended family to deal with</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.139" end="01:12:31.339" style="s2">either. Just do whatever makes you</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.739" end="01:12:33.639" style="s2">happy.</p>
<p begin="01:12:31.339" end="01:12:34.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to go see Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.639" end="01:12:36.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go with you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.939" end="01:12:37.839" style="s2">As her new grandson in law, I can&#39;t show</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.339" end="01:12:41.139" style="s2">up empty handed.</p>
<p begin="01:12:37.839" end="01:12:41.139" style="s2">Let&#39;s go to the mall and buy some gifts.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.739" end="01:12:52.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really don&#39;t have to buy all this.</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.839" end="01:12:52.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I insist.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.639" end="01:12:57.239" style="s2">Boss, you have a call.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.339" end="01:12:58.039" style="s2">I need to take this. Take this card,</p>
<p begin="01:12:57.239" end="01:13:00.839" style="s2">your pocket money.</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.039" end="01:13:00.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t take this.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.039" end="01:13:16.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you like it, you can try it on.</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.639" end="01:13:16.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.739" end="01:13:24.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome. I wonder what Lily Clark is</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.439" end="01:13:26.236" style="s2">doing right now.</p>
<p begin="01:13:24.839" end="01:13:26.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably crying her eyes out.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.236" end="01:13:28.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.739" end="01:13:30.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She completely blew it with Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.839" end="01:13:31.940" style="s2">Without Mr. Vance backing her up, she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.639" end="01:13:33.440" style="s2">still waiting for Mason to bring her</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.940" end="01:13:35.140" style="s2">that half a million dollars for the</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.440" end="01:13:36.640" style="s2">medical bills.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.140" end="01:13:38.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her life must be a complete mess right</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.640" end="01:13:38.840" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.540" end="01:13:43.940" style="s2">That wretched girl, you should</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.340" end="01:13:45.640" style="s2">definitely teach her a good lesson.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.940" end="01:13:47.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Playing Lily Clark for a fool</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.640" end="01:13:49.871" style="s2">&gt;&gt; was just too much fun.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.851" end="01:13:49.871" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.040" end="01:14:00.940" style="s2">Lily Clark?</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.040" end="01:14:07.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you guys talking about me?</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.640" end="01:14:07.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why the hell is Lily here?</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.121" end="01:14:12.740" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.840" end="01:14:14.240" style="s2">Lily, weren&#39;t you at the hospital with</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.740" end="01:14:15.540" style="s2">Nana?</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.240" end="01:14:17.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep acting.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.540" end="01:14:19.240" style="s2">Shouldn&#39;t I be the one asking you that?</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.440" end="01:14:20.940" style="s2">Didn&#39;t you go back to get the 500 grand?</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.240" end="01:14:23.140" style="s2">How could you be with Chloe of all</p>
<p begin="01:14:20.940" end="01:14:25.140" style="s2">people?</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.140" end="01:14:27.440" style="s2">Let me tell you why. How? Because you</p>
<p begin="01:14:25.140" end="01:14:29.840" style="s2">two are in this together.</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.440" end="01:14:32.040" style="s2">And you lied to me. The one who fought</p>
<p begin="01:14:29.840" end="01:14:35.240" style="s2">off the wolves and saved me back then,</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.040" end="01:14:36.740" style="s2">it was never you, was it?</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.240" end="01:14:38.286" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you figured it out?</p>
<p begin="01:14:36.740" end="01:14:39.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.286" end="01:14:41.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.740" end="01:14:43.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you already know, there&#39;s no point</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.240" end="01:14:46.140" style="s2">in hiding it anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.940" end="01:14:48.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, Lily. We were just playing</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.140" end="01:14:50.040" style="s2">you for a fool.</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.040" end="01:14:51.740" style="s2">Lily Clark?</p>
<p begin="01:14:50.040" end="01:14:53.740" style="s2">What&#39;s with the attitude? You&#39;ve already</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.740" end="01:14:55.140" style="s2">lost Alexander as your sugar daddy, and</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.740" end="01:14:56.440" style="s2">you&#39;re still waiting on that 500 grand</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.140" end="01:14:57.340" style="s2">to save a life.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.440" end="01:14:59.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily,</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.340" end="01:15:01.340" style="s2">are you here to shop for clothes too?</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.540" end="01:15:03.440" style="s2">You know the clothes here aren&#39;t cheap.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.340" end="01:15:04.487" style="s2">Can a trailer trash like you even afford</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.440" end="01:15:06.507" style="s2">them?</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.487" end="01:15:06.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.540" end="01:15:09.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shouldn&#39;t you be shopping at a thrift</p>
<p begin="01:15:07.940" end="01:15:10.740" style="s2">store? What are you doing in a place</p>
<p begin="01:15:09.640" end="01:15:12.840" style="s2">like this?</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.740" end="01:15:14.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what is wrong with your store?</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.840" end="01:15:15.340" style="s2">How could you let some trailer bad in</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.140" end="01:15:16.440" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.340" end="01:15:19.440" style="s2">She&#39;s probably</p>
<p begin="01:15:16.440" end="01:15:19.440" style="s2">crawling with germs.</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.540" end="01:15:24.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. Good thing I brought my</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.140" end="01:15:27.940" style="s2">disinfectant spray. Everywhere she</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.140" end="01:15:27.940" style="s2">touched needs a good spray down.</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.940" end="01:15:33.340" style="s2">What the hell? How dare you push me?</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.202" end="01:15:41.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.042" end="01:15:45.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This gown is the crown jewel of our</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.542" end="01:15:45.042" style="s2">boutique. IT COST $1 MILLION.</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.442" end="01:15:49.942" style="s2">IT&#39;S $1 MILLION.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.027" end="01:15:53.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.942" end="01:15:53.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $1 MILLION?</p>
<p begin="01:15:53.642" end="01:15:57.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE DRESS IS RUINED.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.342" end="01:15:58.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT was this trailer trash who pushed me.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.242" end="01:15:59.642" style="s2">Make her pay.</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.742" end="01:16:02.127" style="s2">Make</p>
<p begin="01:15:59.642" end="01:16:02.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pushed me first.</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.127" end="01:16:04.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:16:02.442" end="01:16:05.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did anyone see that?</p>
<p begin="01:16:04.542" end="01:16:08.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We didn&#39;t see anything.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.742" end="01:16:09.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was this trailer trash who knocked it</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.142" end="01:16:11.842" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.142" end="01:16:13.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re framing me again, aren&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.842" end="01:16:17.192" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.642" end="01:16:17.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trailer trash, hurry up and pay.</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.192" end="01:16:20.468" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:16:17.742" end="01:16:22.488" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me you can&#39;t afford it.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.468" end="01:16:22.488" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.542" end="01:16:30.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.042" end="01:16:33.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Mr. Vance?</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.342" end="01:16:35.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, are you here shopping?</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.642" end="01:16:37.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here shopping with my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.542" end="01:16:38.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wife?</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.442" end="01:16:41.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wife?</p>
<p begin="01:16:38.742" end="01:16:43.542" style="s2">Mr. Vance is married?</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.942" end="01:16:45.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.542" end="01:16:47.542" style="s2">just broke up with Lily Clark and he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.842" end="01:16:49.742" style="s2">already getting married?</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.542" end="01:16:51.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible. This Lily Clark is even</p>
<p begin="01:16:49.742" end="01:16:53.042" style="s2">trying to seduce Mr. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.542" end="01:16:56.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.042" end="01:16:57.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I ask Mr. Vance, who is your wife?</p>
<p begin="01:16:56.242" end="01:17:00.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want to know who my wife is? I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.942" end="01:17:00.442" style="s2">tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.042" end="01:17:03.542" style="s2">It&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.242" end="01:17:09.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily Clark?</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.642" end="01:17:11.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Mr. Vance&#39;s wife?</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.542" end="01:17:13.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.042" end="01:17:15.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw them break up with my own eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.142" end="01:17:18.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Besides, Mr. Vance said he&#39;d be a dog to</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.542" end="01:17:20.442" style="s2">ever go back to Lily Clark.</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.542" end="01:17:22.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, you knocked over someone else&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.442" end="01:17:24.442" style="s2">gown. Just pay for it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.642" end="01:17:27.042" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I give you a card?</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.442" end="01:17:27.042" style="s2">Give it to her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.542" end="01:17:34.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Check the balance.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.642" end="01:17:37.043" style="s2">See if it&#39;s enough to pay for this gown.</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.142" end="01:17:39.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, you probably don&#39;t know, this</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.043" end="01:17:41.443" style="s2">Lily Clark is just some trailer trash. I</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.643" end="01:17:42.343" style="s2">bet she doesn&#39;t even have a single cent</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.443" end="01:17:43.143" style="s2">on her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.343" end="01:17:45.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.143" end="01:17:47.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once, tens, hundreds, thousands, ten</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.643" end="01:17:48.943" style="s2">thousands, hundred thousands,</p>
<p begin="01:17:47.343" end="01:17:50.203" style="s2">millions, ten millions, hundred</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.943" end="01:17:52.343" style="s2">millions,</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.203" end="01:17:55.143" style="s2">[screaming] billions, ten billions.</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.343" end="01:17:57.343" style="s2">There is ten billion in here.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.143" end="01:17:59.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ten billion?</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.343" end="01:18:00.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ten billion?</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.043" end="01:18:01.943" style="s2">He actually gave me ten billion in</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.643" end="01:18:03.543" style="s2">pocket money?</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.943" end="01:18:05.143" style="s2">How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.543" end="01:18:07.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that enough to pay?</p>
<p begin="01:18:05.143" end="01:18:09.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s enough, more than enough.</p>
<p begin="01:18:07.443" end="01:18:12.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife might be from a trailer park,</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.643" end="01:18:14.743" style="s2">but she has ten billion in pocket money.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.543" end="01:18:17.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wife?</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.743" end="01:18:19.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What she&#39;s wearing on her hand right now</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.543" end="01:18:23.243" style="s2">is our wedding ring.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.343" end="01:18:23.243" style="s2">Lily Clark is my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.243" end="01:18:31.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander Vance actually married Lily?</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.443" end="01:18:32.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How is this possible?</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.143" end="01:18:33.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss ma&#39;am, how should we handle these</p>
<p begin="01:18:32.343" end="01:18:34.943" style="s2">four?</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.843" end="01:18:36.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey,</p>
<p begin="01:18:34.943" end="01:18:38.043" style="s2">would you be mad if I beat the crap out</p>
<p begin="01:18:36.143" end="01:18:41.143" style="s2">of him right now?</p>
<p begin="01:18:38.043" end="01:18:43.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have nothing to do with him anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.143" end="01:18:43.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:18:43.743" end="01:18:46.843" style="s2">I&#39;ve been wanting to do this for a long</p>
<p begin="01:18:45.043" end="01:18:50.343" style="s2">time. The woman you threw away like</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.843" end="01:18:53.543" style="s2">trash is my greatest treasure.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.343" end="01:18:53.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nathan, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.943" end="01:18:57.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I should also thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.843" end="01:18:58.943" style="s2">Thank you for stepping aside. Thanks for</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.443" end="01:18:59.843" style="s2">letting her go. I&#39;ve been waiting for</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.943" end="01:19:02.243" style="s2">her for a long time.</p>
<p begin="01:18:59.843" end="01:19:04.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get on your knees.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.243" end="01:19:05.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, please have mercy.</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.443" end="01:19:07.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You people look down on her like she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.743" end="01:19:08.543" style="s2">trash, then I&#39;ll strip you of</p>
<p begin="01:19:07.143" end="01:19:10.143" style="s2">everything. Enjoy your new life in a</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.543" end="01:19:11.443" style="s2">trailer park.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.143" end="01:19:13.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.443" end="01:19:15.043" style="s2">No, no, I can&#39;t live in a trailer park.</p>
<p begin="01:19:13.543" end="01:19:15.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, please give us a chance,</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.043" end="01:19:16.343" style="s2">please.</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.743" end="01:19:17.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sean.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.343" end="01:19:19.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.543" end="01:19:19.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Throw them out.</p>
<p begin="01:19:20.543" end="01:19:22.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.643" end="01:19:25.243" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.543" end="01:19:29.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, please have mercy, please.</p>
<p begin="01:19:25.243" end="01:19:29.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, let me go.</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.443" end="01:19:32.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why aren&#39;t YOU WEARING THE CLOTHES I</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.443" end="01:19:32.843" style="s2">bought you?</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.443" end="01:19:38.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no need.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.843" end="01:19:38.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This, this, and this. Wrap them all up.</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.043" end="01:19:39.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right away, Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.644" end="01:19:41.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:19:39.945" end="01:19:43.744" style="s2">You really don&#39;t have to buy all this</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.445" end="01:19:43.744" style="s2">for me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.744" end="01:19:50.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, are we still buying?</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.344" end="01:19:57.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put this on.</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.644" end="01:20:12.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wow.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.744" end="01:20:12.644" style="s2">Madam looks absolutely stunning.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.144" end="01:20:25.244" style="s2">So beautiful.</p>
<p begin="01:20:23.344" end="01:20:27.945" style="s2">From now on, you are not just Lily</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.244" end="01:20:30.344" style="s2">Clark. You are also Alexander Vance&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.945" end="01:20:30.344" style="s2">wife.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.545" end="01:20:34.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He doesn&#39;t seem that terrifying after</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.844" end="01:20:36.545" style="s2">all.</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.244" end="01:20:36.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.045" end="01:20:39.945" style="s2">We&#39;re going to see Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.545" end="01:20:49.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.844" end="01:20:50.445" style="s2">How are you, Nana? Are you feeling any</p>
<p begin="01:20:49.244" end="01:20:53.144" style="s2">better?</p>
<p begin="01:20:50.445" end="01:20:54.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m doing very well, my dear.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.144" end="01:20:57.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great news. Your grandmother&#39;s surgery</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.945" end="01:20:59.344" style="s2">was a complete success.</p>
<p begin="01:20:57.744" end="01:21:02.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surgery?</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.344" end="01:21:03.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh? Madam, actually yesterday when you</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.144" end="01:21:05.744" style="s2">were on the phone with that scumbag</p>
<p begin="01:21:03.545" end="01:21:07.644" style="s2">Mason Hayes, Nana&#39;s condition suddenly</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.744" end="01:21:09.445" style="s2">worsened. It was the boss who arranged</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.644" end="01:21:12.445" style="s2">the surgery.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.445" end="01:21:12.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to go make a phone call.</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.566" end="01:21:17.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.876" end="01:21:19.045" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.144" end="01:21:20.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, this is bad, Mr. Vance. The</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.045" end="01:21:21.445" style="s2">patient&#39;s condition just rapidly</p>
<p begin="01:21:20.244" end="01:21:21.945" style="s2">deteriorated. She needs immediate</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.445" end="01:21:23.244" style="s2">surgery.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.945" end="01:21:24.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Henchmen, gather the best cardiac</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.244" end="01:21:26.344" style="s2">surgeons in the city here right now.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.744" end="01:21:27.244" style="s2">This surgery must be a success. Failure</p>
<p begin="01:21:26.344" end="01:21:28.545" style="s2">is not an option.</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.244" end="01:21:30.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:21:28.545" end="01:21:32.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it was Alexander Vance who got Nana</p>
<p begin="01:21:30.945" end="01:21:35.144" style="s2">the surgery.</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.545" end="01:21:37.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re here, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.144" end="01:21:37.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.744" end="01:21:47.146" style="s2">Nana, are you feeling better?</p>
<p begin="01:21:45.446" end="01:21:48.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.146" end="01:21:52.245" style="s2">Mr. Vance,</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.745" end="01:21:52.245" style="s2">thank you so much for everything.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.345" end="01:21:58.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; and I married now.</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.946" end="01:22:00.646" style="s2">care of you is exactly what I should do.</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.146" end="01:22:00.646" style="s2">Bring them in.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.046" end="01:22:08.745" style="s2">Nana, these are some greeting gifts I</p>
<p begin="01:22:06.745" end="01:22:10.546" style="s2">prepared for you. Our wedding yesterday</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.745" end="01:22:11.946" style="s2">was a bit rushed, so we missed some</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.546" end="01:22:13.745" style="s2">proper etiquette.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.946" end="01:22:16.446" style="s2">Once you are fully recovered, I will</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.745" end="01:22:18.646" style="s2">give Lily the grandest wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.446" end="01:22:19.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, these gifts are far too</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.646" end="01:22:20.745" style="s2">precious.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.646" end="01:22:22.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana,</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.745" end="01:22:24.046" style="s2">I don&#39;t have much else,</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.345" end="01:22:26.745" style="s2">but I do have a lot of money.</p>
<p begin="01:22:24.046" end="01:22:29.446" style="s2">So I want to use my money to exchange</p>
<p begin="01:22:26.745" end="01:22:29.446" style="s2">for my treasure.</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.146" end="01:22:33.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This pearl is so massive. If I wear it</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.446" end="01:22:35.046" style="s2">on my neck, I could go on stage and</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.745" end="01:22:35.946" style="s2">dance.</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.046" end="01:22:37.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dance? [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.946" end="01:22:39.146" style="s2">Henchman knows how to dance.</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.446" end="01:22:41.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Show Nana a little dance.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.146" end="01:22:44.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please have mercy on me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.646" end="01:22:44.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="01:22:44.646" end="01:22:48.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, what the hell. Here goes nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.542" end="01:22:51.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:22:51.946" end="01:22:54.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling,</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.946" end="01:22:56.646" style="s2">let&#39;s dance for Nana, too.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.546" end="01:22:58.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me? I don&#39;t know how.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.646" end="01:23:00.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you won&#39;t, I&#39;ll do it myself.</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.712" end="01:23:00.732" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.646" end="01:23:07.745" style="s2">BRAVO!</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.572" end="01:23:09.345" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:23:07.745" end="01:23:12.745" style="s2">KISS HER! KISS HER!</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.345" end="01:23:12.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just kiss her already.</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.046" end="01:23:27.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana,</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.446" end="01:23:27.146" style="s2">drink some water.</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.546" end="01:23:33.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, tell me, why do you like</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.745" end="01:23:33.245" style="s2">Lily?</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.745" end="01:23:36.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, my parents have always been biased</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.345" end="01:23:38.245" style="s2">since I was a kid.</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.946" end="01:23:40.146" style="s2">No one loved me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.245" end="01:23:41.245" style="s2">My parents and my brother, they don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.146" end="01:23:43.245" style="s2">love me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.245" end="01:23:44.847" style="s2">Nobody in this world loves me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.245" end="01:23:46.647" style="s2">I grew up alone.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.847" end="01:23:48.747" style="s2">They all called me a freak.</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.647" end="01:23:50.647" style="s2">Sitting in the position I am today, many</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.747" end="01:23:52.747" style="s2">people want me dead.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.647" end="01:23:54.547" style="s2">That day at the train station,</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.747" end="01:23:56.047" style="s2">I thought I was going to die.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.547" end="01:23:58.547" style="s2">But honestly,</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.047" end="01:24:01.047" style="s2">dying would have been a relief for me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.547" end="01:24:03.147" style="s2">But then Lily appeared.</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.047" end="01:24:05.347" style="s2">She saved me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.147" end="01:24:08.247" style="s2">She was so gentle and kind like a ray of</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.347" end="01:24:10.447" style="s2">light crashing into my life.</p>
<p begin="01:24:08.247" end="01:24:12.847" style="s2">I want to hold on to her.</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.447" end="01:24:12.847" style="s2">I love her.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.347" end="01:24:17.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana,</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.247" end="01:24:19.647" style="s2">let me get you some water.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.647" end="01:24:22.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander already poured some for me.</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.647" end="01:24:22.647" style="s2">Come sit down, Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.147" end="01:24:28.947" style="s2">Lily,</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.747" end="01:24:28.947" style="s2">do you like Alexander?</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.847" end="01:24:34.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana, I</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.647" end="01:24:36.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need to answer right away.</p>
<p begin="01:24:34.647" end="01:24:38.547" style="s2">That day when Alexander followed you all</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.747" end="01:24:41.147" style="s2">the way to Oak Creek,</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.547" end="01:24:43.147" style="s2">I knew he had feelings for you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.147" end="01:24:45.247" style="s2">For a man like him</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.147" end="01:24:48.347" style="s2">to put aside his pride</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.247" end="01:24:50.047" style="s2">and go out of his way to please me,</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.347" end="01:24:53.847" style="s2">I know</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.047" end="01:24:53.847" style="s2">he wants to keep you by his side.</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.147" end="01:25:00.147" style="s2">Lily, Alexander is a good man.</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.047" end="01:25:03.747" style="s2">Lily,</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.147" end="01:25:03.747" style="s2">Alexander is a good man.</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.647" end="01:25:07.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.647" end="01:25:16.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you here at the hospital?</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.647" end="01:25:19.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law,</p>
<p begin="01:25:16.147" end="01:25:19.147" style="s2">have you thought about our deal?</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.547" end="01:25:21.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have.</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.047" end="01:25:26.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sending you away tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.547" end="01:25:40.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why the hell did you tear up the ticket?</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.547" end="01:25:41.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what you&#39;re scheming,</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.247" end="01:25:43.647" style="s2">but I will never</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.947" end="01:25:44.947" style="s2">conspire with a stranger against my own</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.647" end="01:25:46.747" style="s2">husband.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.947" end="01:25:47.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you want to leave him?</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.747" end="01:25:50.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.049" end="01:25:51.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do, I&#39;ll tell him face to face.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.749" end="01:25:53.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.649" end="01:25:55.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t ever approach me again. If you do,</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.649" end="01:25:57.049" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell your brother.</p>
<p begin="01:25:55.349" end="01:25:58.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, she won&#39;t cooperate. What do we</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.049" end="01:26:00.948" style="s2">do?</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.349" end="01:26:00.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grab her.</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.734" end="01:26:08.349" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.649" end="01:26:11.149" style="s2">Sister-in-law,</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.349" end="01:26:13.049" style="s2">cooperating is no longer a choice.</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.149" end="01:26:15.849" style="s2">If you won&#39;t leave,</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.049" end="01:26:15.849" style="s2">I&#39;ll make you leave.</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.849" end="01:26:21.649" style="s2">Nana,</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.749" end="01:26:23.948" style="s2">where&#39;s Lily Clark?</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.649" end="01:26:26.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily Clark just stepped out.</p>
<p begin="01:26:23.948" end="01:26:28.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stepped out? I&#39;ll go find her.</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.049" end="01:26:28.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.948" end="01:26:33.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wife? Lily Clark?</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.244" end="01:26:34.864" style="s2">[snorts] Where did she go? Let me call</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.749" end="01:26:36.885" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="01:26:34.864" end="01:26:36.885" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.249" end="01:26:39.749" style="s2">Hello?</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.249" end="01:26:42.649" style="s2">Lily?</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.749" end="01:26:43.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother, it&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.649" end="01:26:47.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it you?</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.849" end="01:26:47.448" style="s2">Why is my wife&#39;s phone in your hands?</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.649" end="01:26:50.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother,</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.749" end="01:26:52.549" style="s2">looking for your wife?</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.349" end="01:26:54.149" style="s2">She is right here with me.</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.549" end="01:26:56.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell do you mean?</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.149" end="01:26:58.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sending her away.</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.448" end="01:27:00.149" style="s2">You didn&#39;t know?</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.049" end="01:27:02.049" style="s2">Your wife has already teamed up with me.</p>
<p begin="01:27:00.149" end="01:27:03.349" style="s2">She never even liked you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.049" end="01:27:05.649" style="s2">She wants to escape your control and</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.349" end="01:27:07.448" style="s2">find the man she actually loved.</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.649" end="01:27:08.649" style="s2">So I booked her a ticket,</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.448" end="01:27:10.349" style="s2">sending her away tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.649" end="01:27:12.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT&#39;S NOT TRUE, ALEXANDER VANCE.</p>
<p begin="01:27:10.349" end="01:27:14.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SHUT UP.</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.349" end="01:27:15.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BROTHER, YOU&#39;RE PATHETIC. Your wife</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.249" end="01:27:17.349" style="s2">dumped you.</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.349" end="01:27:18.749" style="s2">I told you, you&#39;re just an unlovable</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.349" end="01:27:20.849" style="s2">monster.</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.749" end="01:27:23.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER VANCE!</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.849" end="01:27:26.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily Clark, you are my wife. I won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.349" end="01:27:26.049" style="s2">you run away.</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.049" end="01:27:30.549" style="s2">I&#39;m bringing you back right now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.149" end="01:27:38.749" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.049" end="01:27:38.749" style="s2">Where is the boss?</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.549" end="01:27:43.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, bad news. The boss&#39;s wife was taken</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.049" end="01:27:45.749" style="s2">by Julian Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.448" end="01:27:46.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian Vance?</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.749" end="01:27:48.550" style="s2">Damn it, the boss must have gone after</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.948" end="01:27:50.950" style="s2">her. This is bad. The boss IS IN DANGER</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.550" end="01:27:50.950" style="s2">ALONE.</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.550" end="01:27:57.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME GO. Take me back.</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.950" end="01:27:59.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.650" end="01:28:01.450" style="s2">I&#39;ll make sure my brother never sees you</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.050" end="01:28:01.450" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.950" end="01:28:06.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, this is bad. Alexander is on our</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.250" end="01:28:09.150" style="s2">tail.</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.650" end="01:28:11.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me go. Your brother is here.</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.150" end="01:28:13.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The monster actually caught up.</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.750" end="01:28:17.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, what should we DO NOW?</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.350" end="01:28:17.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP PANICKING. DRIVE INTO THE ALLEY.</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.850" end="01:28:25.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE REALLY is a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.550" end="01:28:47.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My dear little brother, where are you</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.450" end="01:28:47.450" style="s2">taking your sister-in-law?</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.950" end="01:28:51.150" style="s2">You got here fast, brother.</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.650" end="01:28:56.750" style="s2">Wife, I&#39;m here to take you home.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.350" end="01:28:58.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander?</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.750" end="01:29:00.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother, did you really think I came</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.250" end="01:29:03.350" style="s2">unprepared? You never leave HERE ALIVE.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.650" end="01:29:04.850" style="s2">BOYS, GET OUT HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.350" end="01:29:05.950" style="s2">BROTHER, I BROUGHT ALL THESE MEN TONIGHT</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.850" end="01:29:08.350" style="s2">JUST TO make sure you never leave HERE</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.950" end="01:29:10.450" style="s2">ALIVE. KILL HIM. I CAME to take my wife</p>
<p begin="01:29:08.350" end="01:29:13.250" style="s2">home. Anyone in my way, DIE.</p>
<p begin="01:29:10.450" end="01:29:13.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER, WATCH OUT.</p>
<p begin="01:29:21.150" end="01:29:25.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS JULIAN, he&#39;s a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.350" end="01:29:28.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useless trash. What are you AFRAID OF?</p>
<p begin="01:29:25.550" end="01:29:28.950" style="s2">WE OUTNUMBER HIM. GET HIM.</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.750" end="01:29:42.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER,</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.150" end="01:29:45.650" style="s2">STAY BACK.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.150" end="01:29:45.650" style="s2">DARLING, let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="01:29:46.750" end="01:29:50.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO TO HELL, SETH.</p>
<p begin="01:29:48.092" end="01:29:50.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:29:56.451" end="01:30:00.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FINALLY, I DID IT. I ACTUALLY STABBED MY</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.951" end="01:30:02.052" style="s2">BROTHER.</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.552" end="01:30:04.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DESPICABLE.</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.052" end="01:30:04.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER.</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.851" end="01:30:17.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m tying you to my side.</p>
<p begin="01:30:14.751" end="01:30:20.552" style="s2">You can never run away again.</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.451" end="01:30:20.552" style="s2">Come on, I&#39;m taking you home.</p>
<p begin="01:30:22.951" end="01:30:25.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.851" end="01:30:30.151" style="s2">Aren&#39;t you brothers? How could you do</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.351" end="01:30:32.651" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.151" end="01:30:34.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There can only be one king, and I want</p>
<p begin="01:30:32.651" end="01:30:36.552" style="s2">my dear brother dead.</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.251" end="01:30:38.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a monster.</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.552" end="01:30:41.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law, I&#39;ll give you two choices</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.351" end="01:30:42.552" style="s2">now. First, you both die together.</p>
<p begin="01:30:41.147" end="01:30:44.851" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.552" end="01:30:46.751" style="s2">Second, you leave him here to die alone,</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.851" end="01:30:48.451" style="s2">and I let you walk away. Which one will</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.751" end="01:30:50.317" style="s2">it be?</p>
<p begin="01:30:48.451" end="01:30:51.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your choice?</p>
<p begin="01:30:50.317" end="01:30:53.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.651" end="01:30:55.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know you won&#39;t let me go.</p>
<p begin="01:30:53.552" end="01:30:58.451" style="s2">You&#39;ve already tied us together.</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.951" end="01:31:00.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As much as I don&#39;t want to let you go,</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.451" end="01:31:00.751" style="s2">but</p>
<p begin="01:31:01.251" end="01:31:05.651" style="s2">how could I ever let you die with me?</p>
<p begin="01:31:03.451" end="01:31:06.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GO.</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.651" end="01:31:07.151" style="s2">GET OUT OF HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.552" end="01:31:09.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.151" end="01:31:09.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:31:12.251" end="01:31:16.552" style="s2">BROTHER, SHE ACTUALLY LEFT.</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.451" end="01:31:19.151" style="s2">I TOLD YOU, you are destined to be</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.552" end="01:31:19.151" style="s2">unloved.</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.151" end="01:31:25.851" style="s2">Brother,</p>
<p begin="01:31:22.251" end="01:31:25.851" style="s2">I&#39;m sending you to hell right now.</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.951" end="01:31:32.293" style="s2">DIE.</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.273" end="01:31:32.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:31:33.552" end="01:31:36.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T MOVE.</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.251" end="01:31:37.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I THOUGHT YOU LEFT. WHY DID YOU COME</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.552" end="01:31:39.052" style="s2">BACK?</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.351" end="01:31:40.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me tell you, I grew up rough in Oak</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.052" end="01:31:43.052" style="s2">Creek with my Nana. Hunting birds with a</p>
<p begin="01:31:40.951" end="01:31:44.751" style="s2">slingshot is what I do best. Watch it or</p>
<p begin="01:31:43.052" end="01:31:47.351" style="s2">the next rock won&#39;t miss.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.751" end="01:31:47.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.851" end="01:31:51.951" style="s2">Why are you back?</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.751" end="01:31:54.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me two choices. Do I have to</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.951" end="01:31:56.473" style="s2">take either? I want us to live</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.552" end="01:31:58.493" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:31:56.473" end="01:31:58.493" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts and clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.452" end="01:32:04.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I let you go and you didn&#39;t leave. You</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.852" end="01:32:05.852" style="s2">came back on your own.</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.653" end="01:32:06.952" style="s2">Now,</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.852" end="01:32:07.952" style="s2">you&#39;ll never have the chance to leave</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.952" end="01:32:10.228" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:32:07.952" end="01:32:10.852" style="s2">Still flirting at a time like this?</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.228" end="01:32:12.752" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.852" end="01:32:14.153" style="s2">Brother, why do you never see me?</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.752" end="01:32:15.052" style="s2">The wolf I let loose back then didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.153" end="01:32:16.952" style="s2">kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:15.052" end="01:32:20.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wolf? Could he be?</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.952" end="01:32:23.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But now YOU ARE GOING TO DIE.</p>
<p begin="01:32:20.852" end="01:32:23.052" style="s2">KILL HIM!</p>
<p begin="01:32:23.984" end="01:32:26.004" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.464" end="01:32:36.952" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.153" end="01:32:37.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS, GOOD THING MA&#39;AM CALLED IN TIME.</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.952" end="01:32:39.352" style="s2">IF I&#39;D been a second later, it would</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.952" end="01:32:40.852" style="s2">have been a disaster.</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.352" end="01:32:42.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again?</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.852" end="01:32:43.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With an IQ like yours, you actually</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.452" end="01:32:45.752" style="s2">thought you could beat your brother?</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.852" end="01:32:46.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do YOU MEAN? YOU ALL LOOK DOWN ON</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.752" end="01:32:47.552" style="s2">ME.</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.052" end="01:32:50.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CUT THE CRAP. TAKE HIM AWAY. Wait for</p>
<p begin="01:32:47.552" end="01:32:50.352" style="s2">boss&#39;s orders.</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.952" end="01:32:57.752" style="s2">Boss,</p>
<p begin="01:32:55.952" end="01:32:58.952" style="s2">your wound is bad. The doctor&#39;s already</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.752" end="01:33:01.352" style="s2">at the house. We need to head back now.</p>
<p begin="01:32:58.952" end="01:33:01.352" style="s2">Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:33:02.352" end="01:33:06.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:33:04.752" end="01:33:08.452" style="s2">I have a question for you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.852" end="01:33:10.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.452" end="01:33:12.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have a plum blossom birthmark on</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.552" end="01:33:14.952" style="s2">your back?</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.352" end="01:33:14.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you know?</p>
<p begin="01:33:22.252" end="01:33:25.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when you were little, did you kill a</p>
<p begin="01:33:23.852" end="01:33:27.752" style="s2">wolf?</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.153" end="01:33:30.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know that?</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.752" end="01:33:31.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, it was you all along.</p>
<p begin="01:33:30.952" end="01:33:35.252" style="s2">Why</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.752" end="01:33:35.252" style="s2">why didn&#39;t I recognize you?</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.452" end="01:33:41.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you ever seen parents who play</p>
<p begin="01:33:38.952" end="01:33:41.552" style="s2">favorites?</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.952" end="01:33:45.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:33:45.952" end="01:33:51.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Giddy up faster. You&#39;re too slow.</p>
<p begin="01:33:53.065" end="01:33:56.752" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:33:53.952" end="01:33:56.752" style="s2">I can&#39;t go on.</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.579" end="01:34:03.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.654" end="01:34:06.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Julian, why are you crying? Quick, get</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.454" end="01:34:07.654" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.754" end="01:34:08.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.654" end="01:34:10.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hit me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:08.954" end="01:34:12.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:34:10.554" end="01:34:13.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many times have I told you, as the</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.054" end="01:34:16.954" style="s2">older brother, you need to take CARE OF</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.354" end="01:34:16.954" style="s2">HIM. WHY DID YOU BULLY HIM?</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.754" end="01:34:26.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOW DARE YOU GLARE AT YOUR BROTHER? No</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.554" end="01:34:27.954" style="s2">dinner for you tonight. Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.854" end="01:34:31.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It still hurts.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.954" end="01:34:31.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go back to your room and rest.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.365" end="01:34:35.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.054" end="01:34:36.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.354" end="01:34:38.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stay here and think about what</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.354" end="01:34:38.954" style="s2">you&#39;ve done.</p>
<p begin="01:34:45.254" end="01:34:50.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.054" end="01:34:53.054" style="s2">lollipops are this sweet.</p>
<p begin="01:34:50.254" end="01:34:55.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The person you said you like</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.054" end="01:34:57.554" style="s2">has always been all alone. No one in</p>
<p begin="01:34:55.454" end="01:34:59.954" style="s2">this world loves him.</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.554" end="01:35:02.554" style="s2">Yet you want to love him.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.954" end="01:35:04.754" style="s2">Then let me tell you, I&#39;m lonely too.</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.554" end="01:35:06.854" style="s2">I&#39;ve always been alone too. In this</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.754" end="01:35:09.154" style="s2">world, no one loves me either. The</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.854" end="01:35:11.154" style="s2">person you like, do you know how jealous</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.154" end="01:35:12.054" style="s2">I am of him? Couldn&#39;t you just like me a</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.154" end="01:35:13.054" style="s2">little?</p>
<p begin="01:35:12.054" end="01:35:16.054" style="s2">Just</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.054" end="01:35:16.054" style="s2">take pity on me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.906" end="01:35:18.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.554" end="01:35:24.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then do you know</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.854" end="01:35:25.354" style="s2">who the person I like is?</p>
<p begin="01:35:24.111" end="01:35:27.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:35:25.354" end="01:35:30.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="01:35:27.054" end="01:35:32.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The person I like</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.054" end="01:35:34.654" style="s2">is you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.054" end="01:35:34.654" style="s2">It&#39;s you.</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.154" end="01:35:41.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t hear you. I&#39;m so sleepy.</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.486" end="01:35:44.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.654" end="01:35:44.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.554" end="01:35:48.554" style="s2">you can&#39;t fall asleep.</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.354" end="01:35:50.254" style="s2">Don&#39;t sleep, Alexander. Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.554" end="01:35:51.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HENCHMEN, DRIVE FASTER.</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.254" end="01:35:56.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES, MA&#39;AM.</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.754" end="01:35:56.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER, PLEASE wake up, Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.254" end="01:36:00.756" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The knife missed Mr. Vance&#39;s vital</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.554" end="01:36:03.356" style="s2">organs. It&#39;s truly a miracle. But the</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.756" end="01:36:04.156" style="s2">wound is deep. He needs plenty of rest.</p>
<p begin="01:36:03.356" end="01:36:06.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.156" end="01:36:06.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, doctor.</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.455" end="01:36:12.555" style="s2">Ma&#39;am, why don&#39;t you get some rest? I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.356" end="01:36:14.356" style="s2">look after the boss.</p>
<p begin="01:36:12.555" end="01:36:16.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. Let me do it.</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.356" end="01:36:16.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:36:17.756" end="01:36:20.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mhm.</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.026" end="01:36:26.991" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.336" end="01:36:29.011" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.991" end="01:36:29.011" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:36:30.356" end="01:36:35.656" style="s2">Alexander, you need to wake up soon.</p>
<p begin="01:36:33.356" end="01:36:37.455" style="s2">When you wake up, I&#39;ll tell you actually</p>
<p begin="01:36:35.656" end="01:36:38.781" style="s2">the one I&#39;ve always loved</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.455" end="01:36:39.455" style="s2">is you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.781" end="01:36:42.455" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:36:39.455" end="01:36:42.455" style="s2">But you forgot about me.</p>
<p begin="01:37:02.356" end="01:37:05.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your parents are here demanding his</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.455" end="01:37:05.856" style="s2">release.</p>
<p begin="01:37:06.756" end="01:37:09.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go take a look.</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.156" end="01:37:16.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.955" end="01:37:18.955" style="s2">tell me, what did you do to your</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.356" end="01:37:20.955" style="s2">brother?</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.955" end="01:37:22.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RELEASE YOUR BROTHER RIGHT NOW.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.955" end="01:37:24.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WITH ALL due respect, they are both your</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.356" end="01:37:25.856" style="s2">sons. Julian Vance stabbed our boss and</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.256" end="01:37:27.156" style="s2">put him in a coma for three days. You</p>
<p begin="01:37:25.856" end="01:37:28.656" style="s2">didn&#39;t care at all. You only care about</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.156" end="01:37:30.955" style="s2">that piece of trash. How can you call</p>
<p begin="01:37:28.656" end="01:37:32.756" style="s2">yourselves parents who are so biased?</p>
<p begin="01:37:30.955" end="01:37:34.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, we have always taught you.</p>
<p begin="01:37:32.756" end="01:37:35.356" style="s2">You&#39;re the older brother. You must yield</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.156" end="01:37:36.955" style="s2">to your younger brother.</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.356" end="01:37:38.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I hadn&#39;t been going easy on him all</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.955" end="01:37:40.455" style="s2">these years, do you think he&#39;d still be</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.856" end="01:37:41.756" style="s2">alive today?</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.455" end="01:37:43.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You.</p>
<p begin="01:37:41.756" end="01:37:45.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could tolerate his past actions, but</p>
<p begin="01:37:43.955" end="01:37:47.756" style="s2">this time</p>
<p begin="01:37:45.156" end="01:37:49.555" style="s2">he dared to target my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:37:47.756" end="01:37:50.955" style="s2">I&#39;ve already locked him up</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.555" end="01:37:51.856" style="s2">and he&#39;s never seeing the light of day</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.955" end="01:37:54.256" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="01:37:51.856" end="01:37:54.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:37:55.955" end="01:37:59.856" style="s2">Alexander, you&#39;ve gone too far. How</p>
<p begin="01:37:58.156" end="01:38:03.357" style="s2">could you do this for that trailer trash</p>
<p begin="01:37:59.856" end="01:38:03.357" style="s2">and send your own brother to prison?</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.257" end="01:38:09.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:38:07.857" end="01:38:12.357" style="s2">From now on, you will call her Mrs.</p>
<p begin="01:38:09.857" end="01:38:12.357" style="s2">Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.457" end="01:38:16.378" style="s2">We are already married, and I will give</p>
<p begin="01:38:14.357" end="01:38:18.156" style="s2">her the most magnificent wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:38:16.378" end="01:38:19.357" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.156" end="01:38:20.957" style="s2">Henchmen,</p>
<p begin="01:38:19.357" end="01:38:24.257" style="s2">escort them out.</p>
<p begin="01:38:20.957" end="01:38:24.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This way, please. After you.</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.457" end="01:38:30.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That ungrateful son daring to kick us</p>
<p begin="01:38:29.857" end="01:38:31.957" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.357" end="01:38:34.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all that trailer trash&#39;s fault. She</p>
<p begin="01:38:31.957" end="01:38:36.957" style="s2">ruined Julian.</p>
<p begin="01:38:34.757" end="01:38:38.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:38:36.957" end="01:38:41.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t Alexander say he&#39;s throwing her a</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.757" end="01:38:42.857" style="s2">grand wedding? All the elite socialists</p>
<p begin="01:38:41.156" end="01:38:45.198" style="s2">will be there. They&#39;ll never accept a</p>
<p begin="01:38:42.857" end="01:38:45.957" style="s2">trailer trash like her.</p>
<p begin="01:38:45.198" end="01:38:49.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:38:45.957" end="01:38:49.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re in for a good show.</p>
<p begin="01:38:54.957" end="01:38:57.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:38:58.357" end="01:39:03.257" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:39:00.457" end="01:39:03.257" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:39:06.556" end="01:39:10.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Start preparing for the wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.357" end="01:39:10.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:39:12.357" end="01:39:14.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling.</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.457" end="01:39:22.457" style="s2">Where is my wife?</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.757" end="01:39:22.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, did the madam run away again?</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.857" end="01:39:35.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET IN HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:39:34.457" end="01:39:37.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS.</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.257" end="01:39:38.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FIND HER. TEAR THE CITY APART IF YOU</p>
<p begin="01:39:37.257" end="01:39:39.957" style="s2">HAVE TO, BUT FIND MY WIFE.</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.857" end="01:39:40.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YES, BOSS.</p>
<p begin="01:39:39.957" end="01:39:41.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HENCHMEN.</p>
<p begin="01:39:40.857" end="01:39:44.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HERE, BOSS.</p>
<p begin="01:39:41.857" end="01:39:44.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BRING ME A ROPE.</p>
<p begin="01:39:47.556" end="01:39:50.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BOSS, what do you need the rope for?</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.757" end="01:39:52.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She ran away again. This time I&#39;m tying</p>
<p begin="01:39:50.957" end="01:39:55.056" style="s2">her up for good.</p>
<p begin="01:39:52.556" end="01:39:57.757" style="s2">Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:39:55.056" end="01:39:57.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:40:01.957" end="01:40:05.258" style="s2">Alexander.</p>
<p begin="01:40:03.556" end="01:40:07.458" style="s2">I went looking for</p>
<p begin="01:40:05.258" end="01:40:09.358" style="s2">Why are you here?</p>
<p begin="01:40:07.458" end="01:40:11.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You went looking for me?</p>
<p begin="01:40:09.358" end="01:40:11.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="01:40:12.969" end="01:40:16.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.279" end="01:40:16.299" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.558" end="01:40:23.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Baby,</p>
<p begin="01:40:22.058" end="01:40:27.158" style="s2">I&#39;m begging you please don&#39;t run away</p>
<p begin="01:40:23.558" end="01:40:27.158" style="s2">again. I really can&#39;t live without you.</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.458" end="01:40:30.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:40:30.358" end="01:40:33.958" style="s2">I won&#39;t run away anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:40:32.158" end="01:40:36.758" style="s2">Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.958" end="01:40:38.458" style="s2">I want to be your real wife.</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.758" end="01:40:40.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.458" end="01:40:40.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:40:53.058" end="01:40:57.858" style="s2">There are so many people here.</p>
<p begin="01:40:55.158" end="01:40:57.858" style="s2">They&#39;re all watching.</p>
<p begin="01:40:59.258" end="01:41:01.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you see?</p>
<p begin="01:41:00.158" end="01:41:04.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Vance,</p>
<p begin="01:41:01.558" end="01:41:06.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; we didn&#39;t see anything.</p>
<p begin="01:41:04.059" end="01:41:06.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:41:06.458" end="01:41:10.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait,</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.458" end="01:41:10.458" style="s2">why are you holding a rope?</p>
<p begin="01:41:14.058" end="01:41:18.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh, I I&#39;m trying to lose weight lately.</p>
<p begin="01:41:16.758" end="01:41:22.358" style="s2">I&#39;m practicing jumping rope.</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.758" end="01:41:22.358" style="s2">Look, I&#39;m really good at it.</p>
<p begin="01:41:23.710" end="01:41:25.730" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:41:29.605" end="01:41:31.625" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:41:31.758" end="01:41:35.358" style="s2">Darling, let&#39;s go upstairs.</p>
<p begin="01:41:39.858" end="01:41:42.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Setting me up again?</p>
<p begin="01:41:41.458" end="01:41:45.658" style="s2">I deserve a seat at the head table at</p>
<p begin="01:41:42.858" end="01:41:45.658" style="s2">the boss&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:41:51.875" end="01:41:53.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.258" end="01:41:57.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:41:56.258" end="01:41:59.158" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:41:57.958" end="01:42:03.058" style="s2">Are you still not ready?</p>
<p begin="01:41:59.158" end="01:42:03.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still have injuries. We can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:42:10.859" end="01:42:15.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whether I can or not,</p>
<p begin="01:42:13.059" end="01:42:17.420" style="s2">you&#39;ll find out in a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:42:15.359" end="01:42:18.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:42:17.420" end="01:42:20.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:42:18.159" end="01:42:20.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it now?</p>
<p begin="01:42:21.659" end="01:42:26.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s still daytime.</p>
<p begin="01:42:23.559" end="01:42:26.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It will be dark soon.</p>
<p begin="01:42:26.959" end="01:42:29.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.555" end="01:42:31.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:42:29.959" end="01:42:34.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it this time?</p>
<p begin="01:42:31.759" end="01:42:37.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be gentle.</p>
<p begin="01:42:34.459" end="01:42:37.359" style="s2">It&#39;s my first time.</p>
<p begin="01:42:52.135" end="01:42:54.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:43:13.096" end="01:43:16.159" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.359" end="01:43:18.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be nervous, my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.159" end="01:43:19.859" style="s2">It&#39;s my first time, too.</p>
<p begin="01:43:18.059" end="01:43:21.959" style="s2">But what you just said to me,</p>
<p begin="01:43:19.859" end="01:43:23.159" style="s2">was it all true?</p>
<p begin="01:43:21.959" end="01:43:24.659" style="s2">Could you</p>
<p begin="01:43:23.159" end="01:43:26.559" style="s2">say it again?</p>
<p begin="01:43:24.659" end="01:43:29.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I want to be Alexander Vance&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:43:26.559" end="01:43:29.159" style="s2">real wife.</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.359" end="01:43:33.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will give you the grandest wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.659" end="01:43:36.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:43:39.559" end="01:43:43.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But</p>
<p begin="01:43:41.059" end="01:43:45.159" style="s2">what about the man you love?</p>
<p begin="01:43:43.959" end="01:43:46.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you want to know who the man I love</p>
<p begin="01:43:45.159" end="01:43:48.059" style="s2">is?</p>
<p begin="01:43:46.359" end="01:43:50.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.059" end="01:43:52.259" style="s2">I&#39;m so insanely jealous of him. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:43:50.159" end="01:43:53.459" style="s2">afraid I won&#39;t be able to control myself</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.259" end="01:43:54.859" style="s2">and I&#39;ll throw him into the ocean to</p>
<p begin="01:43:53.459" end="01:43:57.359" style="s2">feed the sharks.</p>
<p begin="01:43:54.859" end="01:43:57.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.259" end="01:44:03.159" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll tell you</p>
<p begin="01:44:00.459" end="01:44:03.159" style="s2">at our wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:44:39.361" end="01:44:43.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Vance, congratulations on Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:44:41.361" end="01:44:44.961" style="s2">Vance&#39;s wedding today. This wedding of</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.261" end="01:44:46.861" style="s2">the century has caused sensation in the</p>
<p begin="01:44:44.961" end="01:44:49.061" style="s2">entire city. It&#39;s obvious how much Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.861" end="01:44:51.761" style="s2">Vance dotes on his wife. Oh, where is</p>
<p begin="01:44:49.061" end="01:44:51.761" style="s2">the bride?</p>
<p begin="01:44:58.261" end="01:45:02.561" style="s2">Wow, the bride is absolutely stunning.</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.361" end="01:45:07.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, you&#39;re Lily Clark, the girl from the</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.461" end="01:45:11.161" style="s2">trailer park?</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.961" end="01:45:13.061" style="s2">Is she Alexander Vance&#39;s biased mother?</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.161" end="01:45:15.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No matter how pretty she is, she&#39;s still</p>
<p begin="01:45:13.061" end="01:45:18.061" style="s2">just some trailer trash.</p>
<p begin="01:45:15.161" end="01:45:20.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, being pretty is quite useful.</p>
<p begin="01:45:18.061" end="01:45:23.261" style="s2">Didn&#39;t she seduce Mr. Vance and gold</p>
<p begin="01:45:20.461" end="01:45:26.561" style="s2">digger her way into high society?</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.261" end="01:45:26.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come, let&#39;s go take our seats.</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.661" end="01:45:40.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, I almost forgot.</p>
<p begin="01:45:38.461" end="01:45:42.261" style="s2">Where you&#39;re standing is for serving tea</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.161" end="01:45:44.661" style="s2">and water. You don&#39;t have a seat.</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.261" end="01:45:46.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Vance, has your new daughter-in-law</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.661" end="01:45:49.361" style="s2">paid her respects with tea yet?</p>
<p begin="01:45:46.561" end="01:45:49.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone come here.</p>
<p begin="01:45:52.661" end="01:45:55.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may serve the tea now.</p>
<p begin="01:45:54.461" end="01:45:55.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly are you trying to do? Just</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.761" end="01:45:59.161" style="s2">serve</p>
<p begin="01:45:55.961" end="01:45:59.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Serve the tea now.</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.461" end="01:46:03.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET YOUR FILTHY HANDS OFF HER.</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.261" end="01:46:10.761" style="s2">TAKE your filthy HANDS OFF HER.</p>
<p begin="01:46:09.261" end="01:46:12.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER.</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.761" end="01:46:15.262" style="s2">ALEXANDER.</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.462" end="01:46:15.262" style="s2">MR. VANCE.</p>
<p begin="01:46:17.462" end="01:46:22.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You force my wife to serve tea?</p>
<p begin="01:46:19.363" end="01:46:25.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How dare you touch Mrs. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:46:22.562" end="01:46:25.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please Mr. Vance, forgive me.</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.013" end="01:46:27.688" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.668" end="01:46:27.688" style="s2">[gasps and laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:46:29.363" end="01:46:31.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did it burn you?</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.762" end="01:46:38.662" style="s2">You forced my wife to serve tea?</p>
<p begin="01:46:36.962" end="01:46:41.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A daughter-in-law serving tea to her</p>
<p begin="01:46:38.662" end="01:46:41.162" style="s2">elders?</p>
<p begin="01:46:41.962" end="01:46:46.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With tea this hot, care for a sip</p>
<p begin="01:46:43.762" end="01:46:46.262" style="s2">yourself?</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.662" end="01:46:52.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Get it away from me.</p>
<p begin="01:46:51.363" end="01:46:55.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen to me carefully.</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.962" end="01:46:58.562" style="s2">From now on, whatever my wife says is</p>
<p begin="01:46:55.762" end="01:46:58.562" style="s2">the only rule.</p>
<p begin="01:46:59.162" end="01:47:04.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You misunderstood, Mr. Vance. We were</p>
<p begin="01:47:01.162" end="01:47:04.762" style="s2">just asking Mrs. Vance.</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.262" end="01:47:12.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Remember this, my love.</p>
<p begin="01:47:10.062" end="01:47:14.062" style="s2">Whatever position I hold among men, you</p>
<p begin="01:47:12.363" end="01:47:15.363" style="s2">hold the exact same position among</p>
<p begin="01:47:14.062" end="01:47:17.062" style="s2">women.</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.363" end="01:47:18.762" style="s2">And if they tell you to take a seat and</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.062" end="01:47:21.863" style="s2">it&#39;s not the head of the table, THEN</p>
<p begin="01:47:18.762" end="01:47:21.863" style="s2">FLIP THE DAMN TABLE.</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.462" end="01:47:33.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER, YOU&#39;VE GONE TOO FAR.</p>
<p begin="01:47:31.562" end="01:47:35.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife is my bottom line.</p>
<p begin="01:47:33.462" end="01:47:37.162" style="s2">If you ever cross her again, I&#39;ll exile</p>
<p begin="01:47:35.162" end="01:47:38.962" style="s2">you to a retirement estate abroad.</p>
<p begin="01:47:37.162" end="01:47:41.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="01:47:38.962" end="01:47:41.662" style="s2">Oh my.</p>
<p begin="01:47:41.962" end="01:47:44.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling,</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.962" end="01:47:46.562" style="s2">you look absolutely stunning today.</p>
<p begin="01:47:44.962" end="01:47:49.662" style="s2">I invited a few special guests.</p>
<p begin="01:47:46.562" end="01:47:50.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily. Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:47:49.662" end="01:47:51.162" style="s2">Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:47:50.462" end="01:47:52.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.162" end="01:47:52.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.129" end="01:47:55.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:47:52.662" end="01:47:56.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bob, Martha, John, Susan, how did you</p>
<p begin="01:47:55.363" end="01:47:59.334" style="s2">guys get here?</p>
<p begin="01:47:56.262" end="01:47:59.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance sent a private car for us.</p>
<p begin="01:47:59.334" end="01:48:01.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:47:59.962" end="01:48:04.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We basically watched Lily grow up that</p>
<p begin="01:48:01.962" end="01:48:04.962" style="s2">we finally get to see her walk down the</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.162" end="01:48:07.262" style="s2">aisle.</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.962" end="01:48:09.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today, everyone from Oak Creek is here</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.262" end="01:48:10.762" style="s2">to celebrate Lily&#39;s wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:48:09.363" end="01:48:12.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Lily, where&#39;s your Nana?</p>
<p begin="01:48:10.762" end="01:48:14.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My Nana? She&#39;ll be here any minute.</p>
<p begin="01:48:12.762" end="01:48:16.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I I believe Alexander invited this</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.262" end="01:48:18.563" style="s2">trailer trash.</p>
<p begin="01:48:16.263" end="01:48:20.763" style="s2">It&#39;s way too good for them.</p>
<p begin="01:48:18.563" end="01:48:22.163" style="s2">I heard Mr. Vance invited Mr. Sterling</p>
<p begin="01:48:20.763" end="01:48:26.263" style="s2">to officiate.</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.163" end="01:48:26.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling has arrived.</p>
<p begin="01:48:45.063" end="01:48:48.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling,</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.763" end="01:48:51.464" style="s2">this is Lily, my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.663" end="01:48:53.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excellent. Excellent.</p>
<p begin="01:48:51.464" end="01:48:55.063" style="s2">Alexander, seeing you get married truly</p>
<p begin="01:48:53.663" end="01:48:56.464" style="s2">brings me joy.</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.063" end="01:48:57.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The time is approaching. The boss</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.464" end="01:48:58.964" style="s2">specifically invited the legendary diva</p>
<p begin="01:48:57.864" end="01:49:00.964" style="s2">Madame Bianca to perform.</p>
<p begin="01:48:58.964" end="01:49:04.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This wedding, Mr. Vance really put his</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.964" end="01:49:06.364" style="s2">heart into it, making it so grand.</p>
<p begin="01:49:04.563" end="01:49:08.263" style="s2">I heard you are a huge fan of opera, Mr.</p>
<p begin="01:49:06.364" end="01:49:10.663" style="s2">Sterling.</p>
<p begin="01:49:08.263" end="01:49:13.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Indeed I am. Madame Bianca will be</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.663" end="01:49:13.663" style="s2">arriving very soon.</p>
<p begin="01:49:16.964" end="01:49:21.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch what you&#39;re doing.</p>
<p begin="01:49:18.364" end="01:49:22.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry, Mr. Vance. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:49:21.263" end="01:49:24.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s fine. It&#39;s fine. I&#39;ll just go</p>
<p begin="01:49:22.563" end="01:49:26.864" style="s2">change. I&#39;ll go change my dress first.</p>
<p begin="01:49:24.263" end="01:49:26.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, go ahead.</p>
<p begin="01:49:37.585" end="01:49:40.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:49:38.163" end="01:49:42.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="01:49:40.063" end="01:49:43.364" style="s2">What happened? Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="01:49:42.663" end="01:49:45.763" style="s2">What?</p>
<p begin="01:49:43.364" end="01:49:48.066" style="s2">Madame Bianca.</p>
<p begin="01:49:45.763" end="01:49:49.263" style="s2">She is Madame Bianca?</p>
<p begin="01:49:48.066" end="01:49:50.763" style="s2">[gasps and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.263" end="01:49:53.364" style="s2">How? THE BRIDE KNOCKED DOWN MADAME</p>
<p begin="01:49:50.763" end="01:49:53.364" style="s2">BIANCA.</p>
<p begin="01:49:53.464" end="01:49:55.926" style="s2">HEY,</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.464" end="01:49:57.946" style="s2">please wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:49:55.926" end="01:49:57.946" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:49:59.464" end="01:50:04.063" style="s2">Oh no, it&#39;s terrible. The bride, she</p>
<p begin="01:50:02.364" end="01:50:04.864" style="s2">knocked down Madame Bianca.</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.063" end="01:50:07.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My wife?</p>
<p begin="01:50:04.864" end="01:50:10.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, what is going on? Madame</p>
<p begin="01:50:07.663" end="01:50:13.364" style="s2">Bianca is a world-class opera legend.</p>
<p begin="01:50:10.864" end="01:50:15.263" style="s2">How could Lily be so reckless?</p>
<p begin="01:50:13.364" end="01:50:16.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you this trailer trash simply</p>
<p begin="01:50:15.263" end="01:50:18.265" style="s2">doesn&#39;t belong here.</p>
<p begin="01:50:16.464" end="01:50:18.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, what the hell is that supposed</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.265" end="01:50:19.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; mean?</p>
<p begin="01:50:18.765" end="01:50:20.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm.</p>
<p begin="01:50:19.265" end="01:50:22.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, why do you look down on us poor</p>
<p begin="01:50:20.765" end="01:50:23.865" style="s2">folks? Why do you look down on our Lily?</p>
<p begin="01:50:22.465" end="01:50:25.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see how it is. You never wanted us</p>
<p begin="01:50:23.865" end="01:50:28.865" style="s2">here in the first place. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:50:25.265" end="01:50:28.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. Wait a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:50:31.165" end="01:50:35.165" style="s2">The bride knocked over Madame Bianca.</p>
<p begin="01:50:33.265" end="01:50:37.765" style="s2">That&#39;s a fact.</p>
<p begin="01:50:35.165" end="01:50:40.865" style="s2">Now the opera is ruined. The schedule is</p>
<p begin="01:50:37.765" end="01:50:40.865" style="s2">completely wrecked.</p>
<p begin="01:50:41.865" end="01:50:45.265" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:50:43.365" end="01:50:46.465" style="s2">this is a sign.</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.265" end="01:50:47.665" style="s2">Why don&#39;t we just cancel the wedding</p>
<p begin="01:50:46.465" end="01:50:50.165" style="s2">today?</p>
<p begin="01:50:47.665" end="01:50:51.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alexander, you should reconsider</p>
<p begin="01:50:50.165" end="01:50:54.065" style="s2">marrying this trailer trash.</p>
<p begin="01:50:51.465" end="01:50:54.065" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silence.</p>
<p begin="01:50:55.465" end="01:50:59.365" style="s2">Alexander,</p>
<p begin="01:50:57.865" end="01:51:02.736" style="s2">it&#39;s time.</p>
<p begin="01:50:59.365" end="01:51:03.965" style="s2">Madame Bianca had an accident.</p>
<p begin="01:51:02.736" end="01:51:06.765" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.965" end="01:51:06.765" style="s2">What do we do now?</p>
<p begin="01:51:14.565" end="01:51:17.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bravo.</p>
<p begin="01:51:24.351" end="01:51:26.371" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:51:27.265" end="01:51:29.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily?</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.965" end="01:51:37.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is Lily going on stage?</p>
<p begin="01:51:35.165" end="01:51:39.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she actually trying to sing opera?</p>
<p begin="01:51:37.265" end="01:51:40.865" style="s2">How could she possibly sing opera? I bet</p>
<p begin="01:51:39.565" end="01:51:41.965" style="s2">she&#39;s just going up there to make a fool</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.865" end="01:51:44.665" style="s2">of herself.</p>
<p begin="01:51:41.965" end="01:51:47.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He sings of finding a familiar soul far</p>
<p begin="01:51:44.665" end="01:51:49.965" style="s2">from home, every step filled with</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.265" end="01:51:53.865" style="s2">longing. The one below the stage,</p>
<p begin="01:51:49.965" end="01:51:57.465" style="s2">crowned with glory, yet fails to see the</p>
<p begin="01:51:53.865" end="01:51:59.065" style="s2">old love standing in the light.</p>
<p begin="01:51:57.465" end="01:52:00.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is absolutely magnificent.</p>
<p begin="01:51:59.065" end="01:52:04.465" style="s2">Alexander, I never expected your wife to</p>
<p begin="01:52:00.965" end="01:52:06.765" style="s2">actually sing classical opera so well,</p>
<p begin="01:52:04.465" end="01:52:09.165" style="s2">even if Madame Bianca herself were here.</p>
<p begin="01:52:06.765" end="01:52:11.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her performance is just as breathtaking.</p>
<p begin="01:52:09.165" end="01:52:15.165" style="s2">Exactly. Her voice is even purer than</p>
<p begin="01:52:11.165" end="01:52:15.165" style="s2">Madame Bianca&#39;s and more nuanced.</p>
<p begin="01:52:21.965" end="01:52:25.066" style="s2">Thank you all.</p>
<p begin="01:52:23.166" end="01:52:27.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bravo. Bravo.</p>
<p begin="01:52:25.066" end="01:52:27.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bravo.</p>
<p begin="01:52:38.866" end="01:52:43.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily, I can&#39;t believe you can sing</p>
<p begin="01:52:41.966" end="01:52:44.666" style="s2">opera.</p>
<p begin="01:52:43.066" end="01:52:46.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Sterling, when I stepped out</p>
<p begin="01:52:44.666" end="01:52:48.666" style="s2">earlier, I bumped into Madame Bianca.</p>
<p begin="01:52:46.966" end="01:52:50.366" style="s2">She wasn&#39;t feeling well, so I had</p>
<p begin="01:52:48.666" end="01:52:52.566" style="s2">someone take her to the VIP hospital. I</p>
<p begin="01:52:50.366" end="01:52:54.366" style="s2">had no choice but to step in for her at</p>
<p begin="01:52:52.566" end="01:52:55.566" style="s2">the last minute.</p>
<p begin="01:52:54.366" end="01:52:57.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Darling,</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.566" end="01:52:59.328" style="s2">you know nursing, you play the harp, and</p>
<p begin="01:52:57.366" end="01:53:00.666" style="s2">now you sing opera?</p>
<p begin="01:52:59.328" end="01:53:02.666" style="s2">[snorts] How many more secrets are you</p>
<p begin="01:53:00.666" end="01:53:05.066" style="s2">hiding from me?</p>
<p begin="01:53:02.666" end="01:53:06.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I am from Oak Creek.</p>
<p begin="01:53:05.066" end="01:53:08.666" style="s2">Our Oak Creek might not be as glamorous</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.666" end="01:53:10.766" style="s2">as the big city, but Oak Creek has</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.666" end="01:53:12.066" style="s2">beautiful mountains, rivers, and endless</p>
<p begin="01:53:10.766" end="01:53:14.666" style="s2">forests.</p>
<p begin="01:53:12.066" end="01:53:15.966" style="s2">They nurtured us and made us who we are.</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.666" end="01:53:17.866" style="s2">We are not ashamed of being from Oak</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.966" end="01:53:19.166" style="s2">Creek. In fact, we carry it as our</p>
<p begin="01:53:17.866" end="01:53:21.966" style="s2">greatest honor.</p>
<p begin="01:53:19.166" end="01:53:21.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well said.</p>
<p begin="01:53:23.266" end="01:53:26.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have so many talented people in Oak</p>
<p begin="01:53:25.566" end="01:53:28.266" style="s2">Creek.</p>
<p begin="01:53:26.766" end="01:53:30.166" style="s2">We have</p>
<p begin="01:53:28.266" end="01:53:31.666" style="s2">Uncle Ray.</p>
<p begin="01:53:30.166" end="01:53:33.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I play the fiddle.</p>
<p begin="01:53:31.666" end="01:53:35.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uncle Pete.</p>
<p begin="01:53:33.366" end="01:53:36.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am a master of the accordion.</p>
<p begin="01:53:35.766" end="01:53:38.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aunt Martha.</p>
<p begin="01:53:36.766" end="01:53:39.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am a seamstress who can sew the world</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.966" end="01:53:41.766" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="01:53:39.866" end="01:53:43.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And so many more.</p>
<p begin="01:53:41.766" end="01:53:44.966" style="s2">They are the farmers who harvest the</p>
<p begin="01:53:43.166" end="01:53:46.966" style="s2">wheat, the builders who construct the</p>
<p begin="01:53:44.966" end="01:53:49.366" style="s2">houses, all contributing to the</p>
<p begin="01:53:46.966" end="01:53:51.566" style="s2">foundation of this country.</p>
<p begin="01:53:49.366" end="01:53:55.066" style="s2">We all live passionately and embrace</p>
<p begin="01:53:51.566" end="01:53:55.066" style="s2">life with pure sincerity.</p>
<p begin="01:53:56.966" end="01:54:01.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bravo. That was brilliantly said.</p>
<p begin="01:54:02.166" end="01:54:06.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today I&#39;m putting my foot down right</p>
<p begin="01:54:03.966" end="01:54:08.166" style="s2">here. From now on, whoever dares to look</p>
<p begin="01:54:06.266" end="01:54:10.566" style="s2">down on Lily and dares to call her</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.166" end="01:54:14.066" style="s2">trailer trash, I, Sterling, will be the</p>
<p begin="01:54:10.566" end="01:54:14.066" style="s2">first to make them pay.</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.166" end="01:54:19.566" style="s2">Do it.</p>
<p begin="01:54:18.366" end="01:54:21.768" style="s2">Bring her in.</p>
<p begin="01:54:19.566" end="01:54:22.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have mercy, MR. VANCE, PLEASE. MR.</p>
<p begin="01:54:21.768" end="01:54:25.367" style="s2">VANCE, [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:54:22.968" end="01:54:25.367" style="s2">HAVE MERCY.</p>
<p begin="01:54:26.168" end="01:54:29.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MOTHER,</p>
<p begin="01:54:27.367" end="01:54:30.668" style="s2">FATHER,</p>
<p begin="01:54:29.068" end="01:54:31.968" style="s2">WAS IT YOU WHO spiked Madame Bianca&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:54:30.668" end="01:54:34.168" style="s2">glass</p>
<p begin="01:54:31.968" end="01:54:35.168" style="s2">just to frame my wife and ruin this</p>
<p begin="01:54:34.168" end="01:54:37.867" style="s2">wedding?</p>
<p begin="01:54:35.168" end="01:54:41.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all because of her. She is the one</p>
<p begin="01:54:37.867" end="01:54:41.268" style="s2">who ruined your brother.</p>
<p begin="01:54:41.968" end="01:54:46.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you,</p>
<p begin="01:54:43.468" end="01:54:47.568" style="s2">my wife is my absolute bottom line.</p>
<p begin="01:54:46.367" end="01:54:51.468" style="s2">Send them out of THE COUNTRY.</p>
<p begin="01:54:47.568" end="01:54:51.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALEXANDER, WE ARE YOUR PARENTS.</p>
<p begin="01:54:51.768" end="01:54:55.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MY PARENTS?</p>
<p begin="01:54:54.268" end="01:54:57.768" style="s2">EVER SINCE THE DAY Julian Vance dropped</p>
<p begin="01:54:55.768" end="01:54:59.849" style="s2">a lollipop on the floor and I picked it</p>
<p begin="01:54:57.768" end="01:55:00.968" style="s2">up and licked it, I knew</p>
<p begin="01:54:59.849" end="01:55:03.268" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:55:00.968" end="01:55:04.668" style="s2">that you never loved me.</p>
<p begin="01:55:03.268" end="01:55:07.168" style="s2">If you miss him so much, I can send you</p>
<p begin="01:55:04.668" end="01:55:07.168" style="s2">to join him.</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.068" end="01:55:12.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss, it is time for the ceremony.</p>
<p begin="01:55:10.367" end="01:55:14.367" style="s2">Alexander, Lily,</p>
<p begin="01:55:12.468" end="01:55:17.268" style="s2">the time has come.</p>
<p begin="01:55:14.367" end="01:55:17.268" style="s2">Let the wedding begin.</p>
<p begin="01:55:26.050" end="01:55:29.168" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:55:26.768" end="01:55:31.367" style="s2">Alexander Vance, do you take Lily Clark</p>
<p begin="01:55:29.168" end="01:55:33.668" style="s2">to be your wedded wife, to have and to</p>
<p begin="01:55:31.367" end="01:55:35.568" style="s2">hold from this day forward, for richer,</p>
<p begin="01:55:33.668" end="01:55:37.068" style="s2">for poorer, in sickness and in health,</p>
<p begin="01:55:35.568" end="01:55:38.867" style="s2">to love and to cherish?</p>
<p begin="01:55:37.068" end="01:55:40.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:55:38.867" end="01:55:43.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lily Clark, do you take Alexander Vance</p>
<p begin="01:55:40.968" end="01:55:45.968" style="s2">to be your wedded husband, for richer,</p>
<p begin="01:55:43.367" end="01:55:48.668" style="s2">for poorer, in sickness and in health,</p>
<p begin="01:55:45.968" end="01:55:51.068" style="s2">to love and to cherish?</p>
<p begin="01:55:48.668" end="01:55:51.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I do.</p>
<p begin="01:55:51.367" end="01:55:57.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I now pronounce you husband and wife.</p>
<p begin="01:55:54.867" end="01:56:00.968" style="s2">Congratulation.</p>
<p begin="01:55:57.468" end="01:56:02.668" style="s2">Kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss, kiss.</p>
<p begin="01:56:00.968" end="01:56:04.568" style="s2">Finally, THE BOSS AND HIS LADY ARE</p>
<p begin="01:56:02.668" end="01:56:05.867" style="s2">MARRIED. KISS.</p>
<p begin="01:56:04.568" end="01:56:07.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KISS, KISS.</p>
<p begin="01:56:05.867" end="01:56:09.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT, WAIT, WAIT.</p>
<p begin="01:56:07.367" end="01:56:10.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong? What is it now, boss lady?</p>
<p begin="01:56:09.068" end="01:56:11.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My Nana isn&#39;t here yet.</p>
<p begin="01:56:10.768" end="01:56:14.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Nana?</p>
<p begin="01:56:11.867" end="01:56:16.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:56:14.520" end="01:56:16.540" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:56:17.468" end="01:56:22.668" style="s2">NANA. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:56:19.768" end="01:56:24.769" style="s2">I&#39;M SO sorry I&#39;m late.</p>
<p begin="01:56:22.668" end="01:56:26.869" style="s2">I went to get a gift for you too. Look,</p>
<p begin="01:56:24.769" end="01:56:28.069" style="s2">look. TA-DA!</p>
<p begin="01:56:26.869" end="01:56:30.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; SO BIG, NANA.</p>
<p begin="01:56:28.069" end="01:56:30.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HERE, TAKE IT.</p>
<p begin="01:56:31.669" end="01:56:35.369" style="s2">OH, GRANDSON-IN-LAW, if you ever crave</p>
<p begin="01:56:33.769" end="01:56:37.769" style="s2">something sweet in the future, just come</p>
<p begin="01:56:35.369" end="01:56:40.369" style="s2">to Nana. In the past, Nana made</p>
<p begin="01:56:37.769" end="01:56:42.169" style="s2">lollipops, cotton candy. That&#39;s how I</p>
<p begin="01:56:40.369" end="01:56:47.569" style="s2">raised our Lily.</p>
<p begin="01:56:42.169" end="01:56:49.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Vance, endless sweets for you now.</p>
<p begin="01:56:47.569" end="01:56:52.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana came today to add a little</p>
<p begin="01:56:49.369" end="01:56:54.269" style="s2">sweetness to your life. Happy wedding.</p>
<p begin="01:56:52.469" end="01:56:57.169" style="s2">Hey, hey, hey. Hurry up and give me</p>
<p begin="01:56:54.269" end="01:56:59.060" style="s2">great grandma children.</p>
<p begin="01:56:57.169" end="01:57:01.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nana.</p>
<p begin="01:56:59.060" end="01:57:01.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:57:01.869" end="01:57:05.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t cherish your own flesh and</p>
<p begin="01:57:03.369" end="01:57:07.769" style="s2">blood from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:57:05.569" end="01:57:09.869" style="s2">I will love him.</p>
<p begin="01:57:07.769" end="01:57:10.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take them away.</p>
<p begin="01:57:09.869" end="01:57:11.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, HEY.</p>
<p begin="01:57:10.869" end="01:57:14.469" style="s2">WHAT ARE YOU DOING?</p>
<p begin="01:57:11.769" end="01:57:15.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET YOUR HANDS OFF US.</p>
<p begin="01:57:14.469" end="01:57:19.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KISS ME.</p>
<p begin="01:57:15.969" end="01:57:21.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KISS, KISS, KISS, KISS, KISS, KISS,</p>
<p begin="01:57:19.669" end="01:57:21.869" style="s2">KISS.</p>
<p begin="01:57:21.986" end="01:57:24.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:57:22.769" end="01:57:26.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT IS IT NOW?</p>
<p begin="01:57:24.069" end="01:57:27.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I CAN FINALLY TELL YOU WHO I truly love.</p>
<p begin="01:57:26.769" end="01:57:28.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is it?</p>
<p begin="01:57:27.669" end="01:57:29.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you remember</p>
<p begin="01:57:28.969" end="01:57:31.969" style="s2">killing a wolf?</p>
<p begin="01:57:29.769" end="01:57:34.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big brother, if no one in this world</p>
<p begin="01:57:31.969" end="01:57:37.869" style="s2">loves you, then I will love you.</p>
<p begin="01:57:34.969" end="01:57:37.869" style="s2">Pinky promise.</p>
<p begin="01:57:39.969" end="01:57:43.369" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:57:41.369" end="01:57:47.469" style="s2">That little girl was you?</p>
<p begin="01:57:43.369" end="01:57:50.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? You completely forgot about me.</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.469" end="01:57:52.869" style="s2">If no one in this world loves you,</p>
<p begin="01:57:50.269" end="01:57:53.769" style="s2">then let me be the one to love you.</p>
<p begin="01:57:52.869" end="01:57:55.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pinky promise.</p>
<p begin="01:57:53.769" end="01:57:57.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A promise is a promise forever and</p>
<p begin="01:57:55.269" end="01:57:57.769" style="s2">always.</p>
<p begin="01:58:07.569" end="01:58:14.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bravo, bravo.</p>
<p begin="01:58:11.169" end="01:58:14.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you, my husband.</p>
<p begin="01:58:14.669" end="01:58:17.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you too, my wife.</p>
<p begin="01:58:17.969" end="01:58:22.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May your reign be eternal and your</p>
<p begin="01:58:19.769" end="01:58:24.069" style="s2">empire invincible to the absolute power</p>
<p begin="01:58:22.269" end="01:58:26.069" style="s2">of the Vance family. May fortune and</p>
<p begin="01:58:24.069" end="01:58:28.570" style="s2">loyalty always be at your side. To a</p>
<p begin="01:58:26.069" end="01:58:30.270" style="s2">lifetime of glory, passion, and infinite</p>
<p begin="01:58:28.570" end="01:58:32.470" style="s2">May your enemies tremble and your legacy</p>
<p begin="01:58:30.270" end="01:58:34.370" style="s2">endure. May the world forever BOW TO</p>
<p begin="01:58:32.470" end="01:58:35.170" style="s2">YOUR NAME. TO THE KING AND QUEEN OF OUR</p>
<p begin="01:58:34.370" end="01:58:36.970" style="s2">EMPIRE.</p>
<p begin="01:58:35.170" end="01:58:38.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LONG LIVE THE [screaming] VANCE FAMILY.</p>
<p begin="01:58:36.970" end="01:58:41.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TO THE BOSS AND THE LADY.</p>
<p begin="01:58:38.270" end="01:58:41.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CONGRATULATIONS.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
